(3006, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '4e715f805c696357159a3f9a70821959', 'Since 1977, the Gisèle Delorme method has made it possible to create a made-to-measure treatment for every skin condition, for all ages. The exceptional results it delivers on the skin are unparalleled, placing Gisèle Delorme in a class of its own in the world of professional skin care.', 4, 10, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', '259afd4c22e9221d40a6f6d7c81dd876', 'optional', 48, 0, NULL, 0),
