(2950, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-685', '5925129fe57cf84e3ec461143842bfdd', '\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Since 1977, the Gisèle Delorme method has made it possible to create a made-to-measure treatment for every skin condition, for all ages. The exceptional results it delivers on the skin are unparalleled, placing Gisèle Delorme in a class of its own in the world of professional skin care…</p>\r\n', 1, 6, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-3/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-0: content', 10, '', '4eda55c0d051f160f451f4d93e6de1c9', 'optional', 48, 0, NULL, 0),
(2997, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '54192299df849e2f88d2a3c0e4b2e1ef', 'Demanding customers who aspire to tangible, visible results on the beauty and health of their skin.', 4, 3, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-0/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-3/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', 'e7e4a7c4e8246ab55d34c7acbdc8ae32', 'optional', 17, 0, NULL, 0),
(2953, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '477a5f24275648703c94ae47d8146e6f', 'A NEW IMPETUS TO REVIVE THE BRAND', 3, 4, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 10, '', 'bdeb86eacd69ceffa5f868c4b1919ec2', 'optional', 5, 0, NULL, 0),
(2954, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '06e71e9811577d97321f258af7e3052d', 'After a period of strategic wandering between the call to switch to a full online service and its professional brick and mortar past, the brand was taken over in 2020 by a small family team who made the clear choice to revive the esthetician’s expertise. To give credence to this strategic choice, the team strengthened the foundations of the Gisèle Delorme made-to-measure skin care method. This method allows for the personalization of lymphatic drainage techniques and haute-cosmétique skincare.', 3, 5, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-0/vc_column_text-0: content', 10, '', '653c2a2a51b0ff1d4aaeda2025747a2c', 'optional', 84, 0, NULL, 0),
(2955, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '768d9c335c2e7591800e1c89432e4f85', 'The team’s focus is revamping esthetician training. Thanks to a high-level training program, they can now join the inner circle of derma-therapists. It’s a rewarding development for both beautician and customers.', 3, 6, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-0/vc_column_text-1: content', 10, '', 'e2ead821cdc276cc34cc3a5f651ead4d', 'optional', 37, 0, NULL, 0),
(2956, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '6bf4d0837417061e2140fcb83319b4b8', 'Considering the multiple factors impacting skin beauty, the derma-therapist determines a treatment protocol for each client. This is the Gisèle Delorme global approach.', 3, 7, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-0/vc_column_text-2: content', 10, '', 'df3536f83b32f7d4645e4cd8bf1cbd22', 'optional', 29, 0, NULL, 0),
(2957, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '988748bd75d8319129bb27232700177e', 'At the heart of the treatment, the manual lymphatic drainage technique is completely revised and enhanced to leverage and target its effectiveness.', 3, 8, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-0/vc_column_text-3: content', 10, '', '4f4dd324024dc2b747471a768b1e6b1b', 'optional', 25, 0, NULL, 0),
(2958, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '52d3de2b8f99898804f520e61eb028a1', 'Inspired by the teachings of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, Gisèle Delorme Facial Lymphatic Drainage uses precise manual movements on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.', 3, 9, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-0/vc_column_text-4: content', 10, '', '97044a7a80cdb880fed419f6a5d44f3a', 'optional', 35, 0, NULL, 0),
(2959, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '955a7f288d06323cba7a00d1b78b9165', 'GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY  GISÈLE DELORME', 3, 10, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 10, '', '3c74a7ce0e53e87d1c7b4f5d125b6558', 'optional', 9, 0, NULL, 0),
(2960, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'd009a79f86ad9d003b7453a8aa9ce813', 'Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.', 3, 11, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-0: content', 10, '', '1f597a45db814688f9ec8e0715fa93dc', 'optional', 23, 0, NULL, 0),
(2961, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'e6b557129968bb0f4fb718d7e15097ba', 'Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.', 3, 12, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-1: content', 10, '', '37230f21f6ece1ef95d784134ed21dda', 'optional', 49, 0, NULL, 0),
(2962, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '48316aca589f6190414049674628abdf', 'Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.', 3, 13, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-2: content', 10, '', '54a997ad9e040a3cf42d4f3ebc367cc3', 'optional', 23, 0, NULL, 0),
(2963, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'adc2741e1f7636de0180594d89f6c023', 'However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the natural ingredient, even at a higher cost.', 3, 14, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-3: content', 10, '', '635c5999168753d46fe0ef63dfa42b8f', 'optional', 43, 0, NULL, 0),
(2964, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '831ac0f675ac79b11510580cbaf027dd', 'To ensure that our actions are in line with our vision, the performance of the products we develop is validated both in instrumental (objective) and panel trials (subjective).', 3, 15, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-4: content', 10, '', '7c4552d101ec43243ef0cecfdbd9fa77', 'optional', 30, 0, NULL, 0),
(2965, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '9bcad9d3efbcd5afa78a1d26bd1b1615', 'OUR VALUES', 3, 16, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 10, '', '2750d2e27685300da53632a3e09dfa27', 'optional', 2, 0, NULL, 0),
(2994, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '8717cd2e55b3ad65dae0e566d0ec770b', 'TO WHOM IS IT FOR ?', 4, 1, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-0/vc_column-0/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 2, '', '4a79a3064c4c788fb63d4c48137e9789', 'optional', 3, 0, NULL, 0),
(2968, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '6489e0ed556fe68ae8aced9c28a59062', 'Formulation', 3, 19, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_custom_heading-2: text', 10, '', 'd5047de1239426b5fed4820a483c1d97', 'optional', 2, 0, NULL, 0),
(2969, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'af577bec8eb3d215549c26ba342b0b7d', 'Our products are formulated with a French know-how by formulators who are totally independent of ingredient suppliers.', 3, 20, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_column_text-1: content', 10, '', '37cc05dc6237a1df0620698ffd7f42b3', 'optional', 20, 0, NULL, 0),
(2970, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'e5bd93346a4c5aba4d6c258c249aa670', 'Manufacturing & Packaging', 3, 21, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_custom_heading-3: text', 10, '', 'cf23be71b931e79177bb02bed53f0cd6', 'optional', 5, 0, NULL, 0),
(2971, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'a23f507607b5e1af9273ca9b5dbd9ef3', 'Gisèle Delorme products are manufactured and packaged by French family-run laboratories selected for their rigorous quality control standards.', 3, 22, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_column_text-2: content', 10, '', 'e0dc188a0535e460e0f8229dfb166a38', 'optional', 25, 0, NULL, 0),
(2972, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'b5189cc55d59e8b5a628dc644993b7e9', 'Raw materials', 3, 23, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_custom_heading-4: text', 10, '', '33ddde69c55fb6b7c1a708aff6b455e3', 'optional', 2, 0, NULL, 0),
(2974, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '1eb24bd760e508043a3cfdfe91ba9489', 'Performance validation', 3, 25, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_custom_heading-5: text', 10, '', '1efaaf7dd4181c5f0fb821f1f2cf210a', 'optional', 4, 0, NULL, 0),
(2993, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'b18eb4ec977431e55a3bed9c3548afe7', 'We select raw materials for their quality and efficacy. We commit to take the best, regardless of price, to formulate the best galenic with the most powerful active ingredients.<br />\r\nAnd where performance is matched, we select an ingredient of natural origin.', 3, 24, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_column_text-3: content', 10, '', '69cbafa46c58d1fbb929c20bd96d1209', 'optional', 43, 0, NULL, 0),
(2976, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'cf270e40d273f9e7fd7c3061729060c3', 'Training', 3, 27, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_custom_heading-6: text', 10, '', '5d3c005d912de00b979fa173e8b1dbb3', 'optional', 2, 0, NULL, 0),
(2977, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'd877dcaa8027a10d575c37b71d384e1a', 'Excellence is also expressed in the relevance and high level of academic interest of our training courses for professionals.', 3, 28, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_column_text-5: content', 10, '', '03e63689c7c116497623a76a7281f947', 'optional', 21, 0, NULL, 0),
(2978, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '87ecc28b30597e5d1375076b74128faf', 'Facial salon or studio', 3, 29, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_custom_heading-7: text', 10, '', 'ddd85666d8951913346a09065cab8538', 'optional', 4, 0, NULL, 0),
(2979, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'ec58418e19f2e55bde8923d6a1805390', 'Excellence is the hallmark of the studios where the Gisèle Delorme method is available. Practicing beauticians and derma-therapists are driven by the demand for a sincere and responsible interpersonal relationship with their customers.', 3, 30, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_column_text-6: content', 10, '', '9843a35c59ecff20b58383e6cb3e4cac', 'optional', 41, 0, NULL, 0),
(2980, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '4da1a46ec20cf93ee5c846a51e04f0ed', '<p>', 3, 1, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/wpml_string_wrapper-0: content', 10, '', 'a91cb40269ae1645fa7ec3786849b189', 'optional', 0, 0, NULL, 0),
(2981, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '19eaff73618db74637c93ab6a5872fbf', 'From the very start of the Gisèle Delorme Paris brand in 1977, Madame Delorme was driven by the responsibility for results imposed on a professional brand and on the beautician using her method of treatment.<br />\r\nThe concept she created need to provide remarkable results for every client, for every skin condition and in every situation.<br />\r\nAnd right from the start, she incorporated the power of serums, a product category little known at the time of the brand’s creation. A visionary, Madame Delorme understood the benefits of these products for in-depth treatment. Her serums were all complex, and some incorporated phytotherapy.<br />\r\nSince then, the Gisèle Delorme brand has become worldwide synonymous for beauty through skin health for a community of discerning women and men.</p>\r\n<p>Thanks to its complete range of serums, it embodies made-to-measure skin care.', 3, 3, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-0/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-0: content', 10, '', 'd62518a3a0102094761e6b971fb59a84', 'optional', 143, 0, NULL, 0),
(2982, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '8e4a5dd5f0984842ae10e83f61357b32', 'Our value: set high standards for ourselves; excellence for our customers.<br />\r\nNotre valeur, l’exigence envers nous-même ; l’excellence pour nos clients.', 3, 17, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_custom_heading-1: text', 10, '', '41e419d47f236014f85db93b018316b7', 'optional', 27, 0, NULL, 0),
(2983, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '9913487830a348015f7189ab7fe896d1', 'We are demanding of ourselves. We are driven by excellence in all areas of our business.<br />\r\nOur satisfaction is your complete satisfaction with the results and the brand experience.<br />\r\nWe choose Partners of Excellence in areas that are at the heart of our business.', 3, 18, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_column_text-0: content', 10, '', '846ce3f4a04fa39f19cac547d99f08e2', 'optional', 43, 0, NULL, 0),
(2995, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '371240a29624455ea26dbb43c16cc50c', 'Skincare professionals, qualified beauticians, motivated by a differentiating specialization in skincare, and keen to continuously upgrade their skills.', 4, 2, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-0/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', '21c7c16cfe0f037082c7effacc8a0e4e', 'optional', 27, 0, NULL, 0),
(2985, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'ebe144b49662a3832a9aa723bed260c2', 'Formulation excellence is measured in terms of customer satisfaction.<br />\r\nWe subject our new formulas to the rigorous test performed by specialized laboratories.', 3, 26, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-1/vc_column_text-4: content', 10, '', 'efaf44cbe0ee93d563d55e1e5aed2e82', 'optional', 27, 0, NULL, 0),
(2986, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '64bddefa402fdc00a38548e87249ce67', 'OUR COMMITMENTS', 3, 31, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-2/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 10, '', 'fba53e7e227c288e60f7d4c9f682f0a2', 'optional', 3, 0, NULL, 0),
(2987, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'f2957d8c30486d399d65954b07613be2', 'Deliver proven, tangible and visible treatment benefits through both lymphatic drainage and the skincare we develop.', 3, 32, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-2/vc_custom_heading-1: text', 10, '', 'f27cb66e6061d1e39357393091e19838', 'optional', 20, 0, NULL, 0),
(2988, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'd68a4124e48835d4b69f8bc6f408805d', 'When it comes to our core business, working upstream and downstream with like-minded people and family businesses in the quest for excellence.', 3, 33, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-2/vc_custom_heading-2: text', 10, '', 'cabfc8653b7f1a6da300dd0baad0c6e7', 'optional', 24, 0, NULL, 0),
(2989, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'fbeb172ecfbc7e21e42c8b22c25de22a', 'Formulating, manufacturing and packaging in France. Almost all our materials come from France, if not from the EU.', 3, 34, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-2/vc_custom_heading-3: text', 10, '', 'c2e17cf450899f362edefa3fd9b5af1e', 'optional', 19, 0, NULL, 0),
(2990, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', 'a978fe52e7e57ffa82973f36e2b8a59f', 'Reduce the footprint of our activities by using 100% recyclable materials, eliminating packaging that adds nothing to the integrity of the product, and reducing the weight of transported products.', 3, 35, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-2/vc_custom_heading-4: text', 10, '', '148159f1559eaeeb2a0c1917f98ba9cd', 'optional', 33, 0, NULL, 0),
(2991, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '1a3234e506835c24a871d5d43ba5f6bf', 'Listening carefully to the constructive criticism of our customers and partners to help us move forward.', 3, 36, '', 'LINE', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-3/vc_column-2/vc_custom_heading-5: text', 10, '', '1b5c4f23898b763c7fc3169769d30e04', 'optional', 18, 0, NULL, 0),
(2992, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32042', '04a7d3d609129a9296bf7ac0608c2097', '</p>', 3, 37, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/wpml_string_wrapper-1: content', 10, '', '22cf95c2ea9c7b91bf57b24cdb3697d2', 'optional', 0, 0, NULL, 0),
(3001, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '65cf2e243fa752244795eca23c43c1bb', 'For people looking for skin care that enhances their beauty, Gisèle Delorme, through its method, technique and products, is the brand committed to this result. Whatever the skin condition and concerns your customer has, our made-to-measure skin care delivers remarkable results. This is thanks to our exclusive combination of haute-cosmétique skincare and our Gisèle Delorme original manual lymphatic drainage technique.', 4, 5, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', '3f2e91453586aee2f99182a879623c76', 'optional', 73, 0, NULL, 0),
(3002, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '0567685afa0b43d5742bdc2d387e78cc', 'Whether it is a younger skin in need of prevention, hydration or treatment of imperfections and impurities, or a skin lacking firmness, nutrition and radiance, the Gisèle Delorme method has an answer to every skin concern.', 4, 6, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-1: content', 2, '', '81f71344b1613f08884de7e5092ecdab', 'optional', 38, 0, NULL, 0),
(3003, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '108902e50245c7114d78b7e57e1de2e2', 'At the beauty salon, your customers will benefit from your know-how and rigorous training as a derma-therapist trained by the Gisèle Delorme teams. With your expert hands, you will deliver a lymphatic drainage treatment whose detoxifying and tissue-regenerating effects are directly visible on the skin.', 4, 7, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', 'feaaefbacfd5bc69a15876fb278a2d08', 'optional', 52, 0, NULL, 0),
(3004, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '2aedb06f7fdcbab8299aa3b049503621', 'At home, your customers will benefit from your derma-therapeutic advice, summarized in their prescription. Haute-cosmétique formulas that can be combined, will enable them to continue their treatment at home, between appointments with a professional.', 4, 8, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-1/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-1: content', 2, '', 'd797d19692543c79e92fd55fe245d6f9', 'optional', 44, 0, NULL, 0),
(3007, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'c1d6e020ba55052a583c4547026eddc5', 'The method draws its strength by harnessing the power of information. All the factors may impact the skin’s beauty are collected through an extensive diagnostic phase. From the outset, Madame Delorme understood the need to include, for example, the roles of diet, lifestyle, stress, hormonal cycle, climate and other factors in defining the skin care protocol.', 4, 11, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-1: content', 2, '', '074ecfc99e8e77e3c0ce7450cd6b1059', 'optional', 61, 0, NULL, 0),
(3008, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'd4852128254dbfc92aff48f6924fa1eb', 'Considering the multitude of factors involved is what we call the “Gisèle Delorme global approach”. It’s the foundation of the relationship of trust between the expert derma-therapist and her client.', 4, 12, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-2/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-2: content', 2, '', 'f0f8bddb74950efe168bc5b25afe3f4e', 'optional', 35, 0, NULL, 0),
(3024, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '57fb1f6f31da1aa73eb279e9364e87a9', '1. For normal to oily skin, you can enjoy the cleansing power of manual exfoliation performed until full flacking is achieved.', 4, 22, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-3: content', 2, '', '1f77ff669a1517ebe2efafec5f1cd1ca', 'optional', 21, 0, NULL, 0),
(3016, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'a020011addb5e1b4aca6b9fc403143f2', '1 – Perfect knowledge of the body’s physiology.', 4, 14, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-3/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-0/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 2, '', '91ffa57530b6267e843fefbb889053a4', 'optional', 9, 0, NULL, 0),
(3010, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '618214d12cde3d84ea31c1617fcdfdaf', 'The method is based on 4 areas of expertise mastered by the derma-therapist:', 4, 13, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-3/vc_column-0/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 2, '', 'bd916e58707fa115d6d4db09d981d00a', 'optional', 13, 0, NULL, 0),
(3023, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'b93ff7f01b2fc4803d682afc2cf89576', 'For example, depending on the diagnosis, in the cleansing phase, the exfoliating cream can be used in 3 different ways:', 4, 21, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-2: content', 2, '', 'f4a24c687cf0a3da34d064154b0ed9ff', 'optional', 20, 0, NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_icl_strings` (`id`, `language`, `context`, `name`, `value`, `string_package_id`, `location`, `wrap_tag`, `type`, `title`, `status`, `gettext_context`, `domain_name_context_md5`, `translation_priority`, `word_count`, `string_type`, `component_id`, `component_type`) VALUES
(3022, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'db7076be73b390728b02d99d08ec7554', 'In a beauty salon, for example, depending on the diagnosis, you can take advantage of the differentiating properties of a same product yet applied differently, of product combinations within the same family, and of a combination of active ingredients from serums to be integrated into almost every phase of the treatment.', 4, 20, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-1: content', 2, '', '63e38318e4243828e43c523c5bc23d37', 'optional', 54, 0, NULL, 0),
(3021, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'e0c1d570e50c8761018ce91ef1eeef97', 'The products of the Gisèle Delorme range are designed to deliver a made-to-measure treatment. You have at your disposal a “toolbox” with which to compose a personalized treatment at every phase.', 4, 19, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', '09d249a4c9ffb7a464168649c9f143f6', 'optional', 34, 0, NULL, 0),
(3020, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '9ae27fb8cc449c7a094cdd83c42494b5', 'THE PRODUCTS', 4, 18, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 2, '', 'c5fdfb02a1dc100774c9a5a8bbc0d1d4', 'optional', 2, 0, NULL, 0),
(3017, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '147853742084e78704b1abae7884d643', '2 – The ability to carry out an in-depth “global” diagnosis, analysing and synthesizing the results to develop a customized protocol (personalized products and drainage).', 4, 15, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-3/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-0/vc_custom_heading-1: text', 2, '', '1a2eedddfe3378169b47e38cd50e3d11', 'optional', 30, 0, NULL, 0),
(3018, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '6bdd31c7c488402917e1d075a460699b', '3 – Mastering the Gisèle Delorme lymphatic drainage.', 4, 16, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-3/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-2/vc_custom_heading-0: text', 2, '', 'c400546fb0e3fa4d50f70e0143b9ddaa', 'optional', 9, 0, NULL, 0),
(3019, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '1dce944f092880992045c02a540a0173', '4 – The relationship of trust.', 4, 17, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-3/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-2/vc_custom_heading-1: text', 2, '', '206808e79f64018648208d475d1a0633', 'optional', 5, 0, NULL, 0),
(3025, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'a33e6f9d50eed1e0621adda8929bdd30', '2. On the other hand, for dull, mature skin with pigmentation spots, this same exfoliating cream should be used in combination with Essential Glow renovating Serum to benefit from a dual exfoliation. Mechanical from the cream and chemical, thanks to AHA in the serum.', 4, 23, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-4: content', 2, '', '4a81a70347ada023cb8c13779f604b08', 'optional', 45, 0, NULL, 0),
(3026, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'adc9e748dda73bf27ae9d164163892a8', '3. For sensitive to dehydrated skin, the scrub should be used as a cleanser. The combination of water and scrub will provide a gentler mechanical action.', 4, 24, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_inner-1/vc_column_text-5: content', 2, '', 'e6c7d973d28a0500fd52e86ca427ee3f', 'optional', 25, 0, NULL, 0),
(3040, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32132', 'acc674c26c51fe60005beee0d86ffde0', 'HOW TO REACH US', 5, 5, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-1/vc_column-1/vc_btn-0: title', 2, '', '4b592cec7a3866402406c0f32f3f83c8', 'optional', 2, 0, NULL, 0),
(3041, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32132', 'd4055f5f325983e19a2d8745b18f1e88', 'GISÈLE DELORME\'S PRESENCE IN THE WORLD', 5, 7, '', 'LINE', 'vc_row-1/vc_column-2/vc_btn-0: title', 2, '', '6701e5636d7f80ee3f8e8745b6bc4d4c', 'optional', 7, 0, NULL, 0),
(3035, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '1270e9c88ef32d838ad45958faa6a019', 'Gisèle Delorme’s product formulas are complex, for several reasons.\r\nFirst, to meet the result expectations of a demanding clients. And results mean formulas with multiple active ingredients.\r\nThe second is the specificity of our galenic formulations. We want to achieve the best possible bioavailability our active ingredients can achieve, which implies the use of sophisticated galenic formulations such as emulsions.', 4, 26, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-1: content', 2, '', 'bd2e171bb744039db87a175cad8e8ed4', 'optional', 72, 0, NULL, 0),
(3029, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', 'c8730c2c6162a670957da9309fabcfe5', 'Finally, two important comments. For the same level of performance, we will select a natural ingredient, even if more expensive. Whenever possible, we use the olfactory note of one of the ingredients to add a fleeting touch of fragrance. There’s no need to overload haute-cosmétique formulas with a fragrance (which is a formula in itself). This approach allows those who so wish to wear their fragrance without it being altered by scent of their skincare.', 4, 27, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-2: content', 2, '', '08a4f23f2d438122ab166389adc2a304', 'optional', 77, 0, NULL, 0),
