(3034, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32097', '763b20b76bff80aadfc140d8298a54c8', 'In the subsequent phases of the treatment, customized combinations are further enhanced\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Combinations of serums to provide in-depth coverage of the various needs required for customized care.</li>\r\n 	<li>Combination of several masks while adding the benefits of serums.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 4, 25, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-4/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', 'f5dc1e6ae3ec95f171ca44030bc2493c', 'optional', 44, 0, NULL, 0),
(3042, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32145', '6529ab80b5fb450d3b040bcbf7e9fe05', 'With the Gisèle Delorme Paris skincare method, you’ll move into a new dimension and become a recognized and appreciated derma-therapist. You’ll provide unparalleled skincare treatments. Your knowledge and know-how will give you a lasting competitive edge, and the reason to add value to your services. At the heart of this method is the unrivalled Gisèle Delorme facial lymphatic drainage technique, originated from the works of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, and a range of top-quality skincare products.', 6, 2, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-0/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', 'afac7880e0b3e583b58c0b49b84c3794', 'optional', 85, 0, NULL, 0),
