(3071, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32180', '81046e1c3a655d07fb0c99f3f3611ee6', 'First essential beauty gesture for a healthy and radiant skin. Our cleansers eliminate make–up and impurities and prepare the skin for the application of complementary treatments. Gisèle Delorme’s cleansing products supply extra softness and freshness without upsetting the skin’s natural balance.', 8, 3, '', 'VISUAL', 'wpml_string_wrapper-0/vc_row-0/vc_column-1/vc_column_text-0: content', 0, '', '7468ab5a4b6deaf334812fc868a5a8b3', 'optional', NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
