(3140, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32303', '096c0b7beadd449c4e5a7f4d5f843da1', 'G.D.I. collects your data in order to process your contact request or purchase. The required data is required for the follow-up of your request. In accordance with the Data Protection Act, you have the right to access, rectify and delete your data. You may also object, for a legitimate reason, to the use of your data. Only you can exercise these rights on your own data by contacting: G.D.I., Correspondent Informatique et libertés, 88 bis, rue Michel Ange, 75016 Paris or gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com , specifying in the subject of the letter “Right of persons” and attaching the copy of your proof of identity.', 18, 15, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-5/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-1: content', 2, '', 'd681d6fa8840671d26eb31cd27e54cce', 'optional', 97, 0, NULL, 0),
