(3142, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32303', '74ddf0699eee54c91223b7d404c8bc23', 'G.D.I. undertakes to respect the confidentiality of data concerning Buyers. This privacy policy describes the personal data that is collected when you place an order with G.D.I. It also explains how your personal data is used, shared and protected, the choices you have in relation to your personal data and how to contact us.\r\n\r\nWe ask you for certain personal data to provide you with the products or services you request, when you place an order on the Site.\r\n', 18, 17, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-6/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-0: content', 2, '', '9b3cfd59a259b25e16c672038e8c73eb', 'optional', 76, 0, NULL, 0),
(3143, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32303', 'cbce6881a44108b319d58f9624b9ddcd', 'These personal data include your:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Contact information such as email, phone number and shipping and delivery address.</li>\r\n 	<li>Your purchase and payment history.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 18, 18, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-6/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-1: content', 2, '', '0d2c1ca296d77a31df205389fc2c6052', 'optional', 26, 0, NULL, 0),
(3144, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32303', 'b13d9dfdeea33faabc3cbbf810e9be65', 'G.D.I shares your personal data with:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The entities of G.D.I. for the purposes and under the conditions specified above.</li>\r\n 	<li>Third-party service providers processing personal data on behalf of G.D.I. for example for payments and credit cards, shipments and deliveries, hosting, administration and management of your data, distribution – with your agreement – of e-mails.</li>\r\n 	<li>Other third parties to the extent necessary to:</li>\r\n 	<li>Comply with an administrative request, a court decision or applicable law.\r\nDefend yourself against third-party claims.</li>\r\n 	<li>Provide assistance in the prevention of fraud or investigation (e.g. counterfeiting).</li>\r\n 	<li>Any other third party in cases where you have expressed your consent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n', 18, 19, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-6/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-2: content', 2, '', '0445b74fbb14f36bc34b5e8ad62fabd2', 'optional', 118, 0, NULL, 0),
(3145, 'en', 'page-builder-shortcode-strings-32303', 'df5200dffcae669592d2ab4c29ac69b2', 'When we use the services of third-party providers, we enter into contracts that require them to implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data.\r\n\r\nFor credit card payments, the data is not kept.\r\n\r\nWe may also transfer your personal data in the event that we assign or transfer all or part of our business or assets (including in the case of a reorganization, assignment, dissolution or liquidation)', 18, 20, '', 'VISUAL', 'vc_row-6/vc_column-0/vc_column_text-3: content', 2, '', 'c95edaac8b189598678ffb09a09c92b1', 'optional', 73, 0, NULL, 0),
