(7881, 32218, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:4:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"How to use your foaming cream\";s:7:\"content\";s:782:\"Use as your daily cleanser during your nighttime routine. Cannot be used as an eye makeup remover.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Drop a hazelnut like size of cream in your palm, add a few drops of water and rub your hands to create a foam.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> Lather your face and neck with the foam, while always avoiding the eye contour area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Massage delicately with circular movements.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water to completely eliminate the product. Rinse with cool water afterwards to stimulate the skin.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5: [Important and shouldn’t be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:34:\"Understand your skin and its needs\";s:7:\"content\";s:1208:\"<strong>Why the right cleanser for a combination skin type is so important?</strong>\r\nThe choice of our cleanser will determine how your skin will react with the other products of your skin care routine. Too abrasive, it will remove the skin’s protective sebum layer thus stimulating your epidermis to secrete an excessive amount of sebum. Your first instinct will be to rewash your face, creating a vicious cycle of wash, secrete, wash… Which is why choosing the right cleanser is so important.\r\n\r\n<strong>Why less cleansing is better for your skin in the morning?</strong>\r\nWith a combination skin, it is important to respect the cutaneous balance while regulating the epidermis. Sebum is essential to your skin’s health, protecting it and maintaining its flora. Cleansing it too frequently [hyper-hygienic] can disrupt the cutaneous balance. It removes the protective layer of sebum, stimulating the skin to reproduce an excess amount to protect itself, creating a vicious cycle.\r\n\r\nDuring the night and thanks to your night regiment, your skin remains clean throughout your bedtime. Fresh cold water to wake up your senses is sufficient and will also stimulate your skin’s blood microcirculation.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:508:\"<strong>ESSENTIAL OILS</strong> (SAGE, PEPPERMINT, TEA TREE) – Scrubs and tightens pores while refreshing the complexion\r\n<strong>PURIFYING COMPLEX</strong> – Absorbs impurities and excess sebum, anti-bacterial and anti-inflammatory\r\n<strong>BURDOCK EXTRACT</strong> – Purifies the skin\r\n<strong>BIOTINE, VITAMIN B8</strong> – Anti-inflammatory\r\n<strong>ZINC</strong> – Healing agent\r\n<strong>VEGETABLE GLYCERIN</strong> – Moisturizes\r\n \r\n<strong>Paraben-, alcohol- and mineral oil- free</strong>\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:937:\"INGREDIENTS : AQUA (WATER), SODIUM COCO-SULFATE, GLYCERIN, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, DISODIUM LAURYL SULFOSUCCINATE, SODIUM COCOYL ISETHIONATE ZEA MAYS (CORN) STARCH, STEARIC ACID, PALMITIC ACID, HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, CITRIC ACID, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), CI77891, TARAKTOGENOS KURZII (CHAULMOOGRA) SEED OIL, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE,PENTYLENE GLYCOL, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, PANTHENOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, DISODIUM EDTA, MELALEUCA ALTERNIFOLIA (TEA TREE) LEAF OIL, MENTHA PIPERITA (PEPPERMINT) FLOWER/LEAF/STEM OIL, TITANIUM DIOXIDE, COCAMIDE MEA, LAURETH-10, COCAMIDOPROPYL PG-DIMONIUM CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE, SALVIA OFFICINALIS (SAGE) OIL, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, BENZOIC ACID, ARCTIUM MAJUS EXTRACT, PANTOLACTONE, ZINC SULFATE, BIOTIN, CARBOMER, CI 42090, NORDIHYDROGUAIARETIC ACID, OLEANOLIC ACID, SODIUM METABISULFITE, ALPHA ISOMETHYL IONONE, CITRAL, CITRONELLOL,GERANIOL, LIMONENE, LINALOOL.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
