(7807, 32299, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:1:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"DESCRIPTION\";s:7:\"content\";s:347:\"Exclusive to Gisèle Delorme. 100% neoprene. The design of this case allows the skincare products to remain upright, avoiding any risk of leakage. The products are well secured thanks to the lined dividers.\r\n\r\n– Original and feminine format\r\n\r\n– Removable dividers for maximum protection of your skincare products.\r\n\r\n– 100% machine washable\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
