(8958, 32220, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:4:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How to personalize your active lotion with its con\";s:7:\"content\";s:799:\"Personalize your lotion depending on your skin’s condition while rebalancing your skin’s pH.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Puncture the cannula of the active concentration with the help of the cap.\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> Remove the cap and place the cannula into the lotion’s bottle.\r\nStep 3: Poor in the entire concentration. Screw the lotion’s cap and shake it to homogenize the lotion and its concentration.\r\n\r\n<strong>Your lotion is now personalized and ready to use.</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply with the help of a cotton pad on you face and neck, after removing your makeup, cleansing your skin and after a facial mask or scrub. Always avoiding the eye contour.\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Carry on with your skincare routine, apply your serum followed by your face cream.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:38:\"Which concentration should you choose?\";s:7:\"content\";s:629:\"To protect your skin’s natural barrier, Gisele Delorme suggests a personalized skin care depending on your skin type. For:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><b>Combination to dry skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion moisturizing.</li>\r\n 	<li><b>Sensitive and reactive skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion soothing.</li>\r\n 	<li><b>Combination to oily skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion mattifying.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nFor optimum results, when necessary, alternate your personalized balancing active lotion between the 3 benefits available to adjust this essential step of your routine to your skin’s needs.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Active ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:543:\"<strong>Active lotion</strong>\r\nLAMINARIA DIGITATA – Remineralizes, moisturizes\r\nMIMOSA TENUIFLORA EXTRACT – Regenerates, repairs\r\nALOE BARBADENSIS – Regenerates, softens, hydrates\r\n\r\n<strong>Mattifying concentrate</strong>\r\nPHYTOPLANKTON – Removes impurities and purifies\r\nVITAMIN E – Antioxidant\r\n\r\nBURDOCK EXTRACT – Eliminates toxins\r\nHOPS EXTRACT – Regulates sebum production\r\nESSENTIAL OILS (CYPRES, SAGE, THYM, PEPPER MINT AND EUCALYPTUS): Purifies, stimulates, refreshes\r\nVEGETABLE OILS BASE (SWEET ALMOND AND CASTOR SEED)\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:1057:\"<strong>Active lotion:</strong>\r\n\r\nAQUA / WATER, PROPYLENE GLYCOL BENZYL ALCOHOL TRIDECETH-9, PPG-26- BUTETH-26, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, GLYCERIN, POTASSIUM SORBATE, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, LAMINARIA DIGITATA EXTRACT, MIMOSA TENUIFLORA BARK EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, CM 9140 / YELLOW 5, Cl 14700/ RED 4, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, Cl 17200/ RED 33.\r\n\r\n<strong>Mattifying concentrate:</strong>\r\n\r\nAQUA / WATER, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED, CASTOR OIL, TRIDECETH-9, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PEG-35 CASTOR OIL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, PEG-8, GLYCERIN, SALVIA OFFICINALIS (SAGE) OIL, CUPRESSUS SEMPERVIRENS OIL, THYMUS VULGARIS (THYME) FLOWER/LEAF OIL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, MENTHA PIPERITA OIL / MENTHA PIPERITA (PEPPERMINT) OIL, EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS LEAF OIL, HUMULUS LUPULUS (HOPS) EXTRACT, XANTHAN GUM, LIMONENE, CITRIC ACID, LINALOOL, ARCTIUM MAJUS ROOT EXTRACT, PLANKTON EXTRACT, SODIUM BENZOATE, BIOTIN, ZINC PCA, CI 15985 / YELLOW 6, CI 42090 / BLUE 1.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
