(8967, 32223, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:6:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Benefits\";s:7:\"content\";s:1392:\"<strong>While this step is one of the most important, it is often put aside…</strong>\r\n\r\nThe epidermis is covered with a hydrolipidic film, a blend of water and lipids. This protective film holds the cutaneous microbiome (the protective barrier against fungus and bacteria) and defends the skin from harmful external factors. This film produces a slightly acidic pH, allowing the skin to naturally defend itself.\r\n\r\nThe pH level of your skin may fluctuate depending on your hormonal cycle, your diet, and external factors but also from your skincare routine.\r\n\r\nCleansing, although an indispensable step of your routine, can create a pH imbalance. The cleansing movements and formula of your product can alter your skin’s protective film and ultimately disrupt the dermal wall. The skin may either become more sensitive, dry, or oily and irritations, redness or imperfections may appear.\r\n\r\nThe Gisèle Delorme active lotion offers a daily rebalancing treatment, in the morning and at night, after removing your makeup, cleansing your skin and after a facial mask or a scrub. The laminaria seaweed provide all the moisture needed for your skin to regain suppleness and relief. The moisturizing concentrate perfectly complements the active lotion for the most dehydrated and dry skin. Thanks to vitamin E and plant extracts, your skin is considerably more protected, hydrated, and soothed.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Result\";s:7:\"content\";s:193:\"Your skin regains suppleness and immediate comfort. The moisturizing concentrate allows a deeper hydrating and protection for all dehydrated skins. Your skin is replumed, soothed and protected.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:38:\"How to personalize your active lotion?\";s:7:\"content\";s:816:\"Personalize your lotion depending on your skin’s condition while rebalancing your skin’s pH.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Puncture the cannula of the active concentration with the help of the cap.\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> Remove the cap and place the cannula into the lotion’s bottle.\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Poor in the entire concentration. Screw the lotion’s cap and shake it to homogenize the lotion and its concentration.\r\n\r\n<strong>Your lotion is now personalized and ready to use.</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply with the help of a cotton pad on you face and neck, after removing your makeup, cleansing your skin and after a facial mask or scrub. Always avoiding the eye contour.\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Carry on with your skincare routine, apply your serum followed by your face cream.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:38:\"Which concentration should you choose?\";s:7:\"content\";s:631:\"To protect your skin’s natural barrier, Gisele Delorme suggests a personalized skin care depending on your skin type. For:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><b>Combination to dry skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion moisturizing.</li>\r\n 	<li><b>Sensitive and reactive skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion soothing.</li>\r\n 	<li><b>Combination to oily skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion mattifying.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nFor optimum results, when necessary, alternate your personalized balancing active lotion between the 3 benefits available to adjust this essential step of your routine to your skin’s needs.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:372:\"<strong>LOTION</strong>\r\n LAMINARIA DIGITATA – Remineralizes, moisturizes\r\n MIMOSA TENUIFLORA EXTRACT – Regenerates, repairs\r\n ALOE BARBADENSIS – Regenerates, softens, hydrates\r\n\r\n<strong>MOISTURIZING CONCENTRATION</strong>\r\n WHITE WILD LAKE POLYPHENOLS – Astringent action, tightens dilated pores\r\n SARSAPARILLA EXTRACT – Revitalizes\r\n VITAMIN E – Antioxidant\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:1158:\"<strong>LOTION:</strong>\r\n\r\nAQUA / WATER , PROPYLENE GLYCOL BENZYL ALCOHOL TRIDECETH-9, PPG-26- BUTETH-26, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, GLYCERIN, POTASSIUM SORBATE, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, LAMINARIA DIGITATA EXTRACT, MIMOSA TENUIFLORA BARK EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, CM 9140 / YELLOW 5, Cl 14700/ RED 4, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, Cl 17200/ RED 33.\r\n\r\n<strong>MOISTURIZING CONCENTRATION:</strong>\r\n\r\nAQUA / WATER / EAU, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, PEG-7 GLYCERYL COCOATE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PEG-35 CASTOR OIL, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, TRIDECETH-9, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, GLYCERIN, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, BENZYL ALCOHOL, ALGAE EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF OIL, MELALEUCA LEUCADENDRON CAJAPUTI OIL, MELALEUCA VIRIDIFLORA LEAF OIL, LAVANDULA ANGUSTIFOLIA (LAVENDER) OIL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, LINALOOL, SALIX ALBA (WILLOW BARK) EXTRACT, SMILAX MEDICA ROOT EXTRACT, CITRONELLOL, PELARGONIUM GRAVEOLENS FLOWER OIL, LIMONENE, CITRIC ACID, GERANIOL, EUGENOL, BETA-CAROTENE, EUGENIA CARYOPHYLLUS (CLOVE) BUD OIL, CITRAL, SODIUM BENZOATE, CI 19140 / YELLOW 5, CI 14700 / RED 4, CI 17200 / RED 33.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
