(8976, 32226, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:6:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Benefits\";s:7:\"content\";s:1488:\"While this step is one of the most important, it is often put aside…\r\n\r\nThe epidermis is covered with a hydrolipidic film, a blend of water and lipids. This protective film holds the cutaneous microbiome (the protective barrier against fungus and bacteria) and defends the skin from harmful external factors. This film produces a slightly acidic pH, allowing the skin to naturally defend itself.\r\n\r\nThe pH level of your skin may fluctuate depending on your hormonal cycle, your diet, and external factors but also from your skincare routine.\r\n\r\nCleansing, although an indispensable step of your routine, can create a pH imbalance. The cleansing movements and formula of your product can alter your skin’s protective film and ultimately disrupt the dermal wall. The skin may either become more sensitive, dry, or oily and irritations, redness or imperfections may appear.\r\n\r\nThe Gisèle Delorme active lotion offers a daily rebalancing treatment, in the morning and at night, after removing your makeup, cleansing your skin and after a facial mask or a scrub. The laminaria seaweed provide all the moisture needed for your skin to regain suppleness and relief. The soothing concentrate perfectly complements the active lotion for the most sensitive and reactive skin. Rich in vitamin A which provides antioxidant, regenerative and healing properties, this concentrate helps your skin regain its natural elasticity and softness; and is considerably more protected against free radicals.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Result\";s:7:\"content\";s:258:\"Your skin regains suppleness and immediate comfort. The soothing concentrate allows a deeper healing, balancing treatment, and protection to the most sensitive skin. It is immediately soothed, softer and balanced, ready for the rest of your skincare routine.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:38:\"How to personalize your active lotion?\";s:7:\"content\";s:822:\"Personalize your lotion depending on your skin’s condition while rebalancing your skin’s pH.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Puncture the cannula of the active concentration with the help of the cap.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> Remove the cap and place the cannula into the lotion’s bottle.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Poor in the entire concentration. Screw the lotion’s cap and shake it to homogenize the lotion and its concentration.\r\n\r\n<strong>Your lotion is now personalized and ready to use.</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply with the help of a cotton pad on you face and neck, after removing your makeup, cleansing your skin and after a facial mask or scrub. Always avoiding the eye contour.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Carry on with your skincare routine, apply your serum followed by your face cream.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:38:\"Which concentration should you choose?\";s:7:\"content\";s:633:\"To protect your skin’s natural barrier, Gisele Delorme suggests a personalized skin care depending on your skin type. For;\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><b>Combination to dry skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion moisturizing.</li>\r\n 	<li><b>Sensitive and reactive skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion soothing.</li>\r\n 	<li><b>Combination to oily skin</b>, we invite you to choose the active lotion mattifying.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nFor optimum results, when necessary, alternate your personalized balancing active lotion between the 3 benefits available to adjust this essential step of your routine to your skin’s needs.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:387:\"<em><strong>LOTION</strong></em>\r\n\r\n LAMINARIA DIGITATA – Remineralizes, moisturizes\r\n MIMOSA TENUIFLORA EXTRACT – Regenerates, repairs\r\n ALOE BARBADENSIS – Softens, moisturizes\r\n\r\n<em><strong>MOISTURIZING CONCENTRATION</strong></em>\r\n\r\n VITAMIN E – Antioxidant\r\n PROVITAMIN A – Smoothes skin and improves collagen synthesis\r\n VEGETABLE OILS BASE (SWEET ALMOND AND CASTOR SEED)\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:753:\"LOTION:\r\n\r\nAQUA / WATER , PROPYLENE GLYCOL BENZYL ALCOHOL TRIDECETH-9, PPG-26- BUTETH-26, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, GLYCERIN, POTASSIUM SORBATE, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, LAMINARIA DIGITATA EXTRACT, MIMOSA TENUIFLORA BARK EXTRACT, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, CM 9140 / YELLOW 5, Cl 14700/ RED 4, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, Cl 17200/ RED 33.\r\n\r\nSOOTHING CONCENTRATION:\r\n\r\nAQUA / WATER, PEG-35 CASTOR OIL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, PEG-7 GLYCERYL COCOATE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, XANTHAN GUM, STYRENE/ACRYLATES COPOLYMER, TRIDECETH-9, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, LAMINARIA DIGITATA EXTRACT, BETA-CAROTENE, CI 15985 / YELLOW 6, CI 19140 / YELLOW 5, CI 14700 / RED 4, CI 17200 / RED 33.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
