(8985, 32229, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:3:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"How to use your seaweed mask?\";s:7:\"content\";s:989:\"For a glowing skin, use daily or at least 2 to 3 times a week whenever you put time aside for yourself, morning, or nighttime.\r\n\r\n=&gt; If using with your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin, eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the mask’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply a thick layer of the mask on your face and neck, while always avoiding the eye contour area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Leave on for 5 minutes.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Humidify the mask with your wet hands and gently massage your face with circular movements for a few seconds before rinsing.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Abundantly rinse off with lukewarm water.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 6: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:206:\"<strong>ASCOPHYLLUM NODOSUM</strong> – Remineralizes, antioxydant\r\n<strong>FUCUS VESICULOSUS</strong> – Moisturizes, softens\r\n<strong>LAMINARIA DIGITATA</strong> – Regulates sebum production, purifies\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:342:\"aqua(water), methylpropanediol, ascophyllum nodosum powder, fucus vesiculosus powder, glycerin, laminaria digitata powder, benzyl alcohol, magnesium aluminium silicate, hydroxyethylcellulose, hydrogenated palm glycerides, potassium cetyl phosphate, ammonium acryloyl dimethyltaurate/vp copolymer, o-cymen-5-ol, dehydroacetic acid, citric acid\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
