(8993, 32231, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:3:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:34:\"How to use your moisturizing mask?\";s:7:\"content\";s:929:\"For a perfectly plumped skin use daily as an overnight mask or whenever you feel the need, morning, or nighttime.\r\nThanks to its non-oily texture, your mask will not stain your pillow.\r\n=&gt; If using with your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin, eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the mask’s virtues.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply a thick layer of the mask on your face and neck, while always avoiding the eye contour area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Leave on <strong>overnight or for 10 to 15 minutes.</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Abundantly rinse off with lukewarm water.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5: [Important and shouldn’t be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:681:\"<strong>HYALURONIC ACID</strong> – Moisturizes, plumps\r\n<strong>HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN</strong> – Boosts oxygen consumption and cell renewal\r\n<strong>VEGETABLE SUGARS</strong> – Deep moisture, restructures, smooths, softens\r\n<strong>BEECH BUD EXTRACT</strong> – Revitalizes, smooths, moisturizes\r\n<strong>VITAMIN E</strong> – Antioxidant\r\n<strong>MANGO BUTTER</strong> – Moisturizes, nourishes, regenerates\r\n<strong>SWEET ALMOND OIL</strong> – Moisturizes, nourishes, softens\r\n<strong>CAMELINE OIL</strong> – Softens, boosts elasticity and radiance\r\n<strong>D-PANTHENOL</strong> – Moisturizes, soothes\r\n<strong>VEGETABLE GLYCERIN</strong> – Moisturizes, softens\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:851:\"AQUA (WATER), METHYLPROPANEDIOL, CETYL ALCOHOL, GLYCERIN, DIMETHICONE, POLYGLYCERYL-6 DISTEARATE, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, XYLITYLGLUCOSIDE, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, MANGIFERA INDICA (MANGO) SEED BUTTER, CAMELINA SATIVA (GOLD OF PLEASURE) SEED OIL, PRUNUS AMYGDALUS (SWEET ALMOND) DULCIS OIL, FAGUS SYLVATICA (BEECH) BUD EXTRACT, JOJOBA ESTERS, SODIUM HYALURONATE, CARBOMER, ANHYDROXYLITOL, ALUMINIUM STARCH OCTENYLSUCCINATE, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), PHENETHYL ALCOHOL, PANTHENOL, XYLITOL, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER, POLYGLYCERYL-3 BEESWAX, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, SQUALANE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, ETHYLHEXYL GLYCERIN, DIMETHICONOL, TRISODIUM ETHYLENEDIAMINE DISUCCINATE, BISABOLOL, XANTHAN GUM, GLUCOSE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, POLYSORBATE 60, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, FARNESOL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, BENZOIC ACID, TOCOPHEROL, SORBIC ACID\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
