(9001, 32233, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:3:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:31:\"How to use your purifying mask?\";s:7:\"content\";s:1011:\"For a purified and refreshed skin, use daily or 2 to 3 times a week whenever you put time aside for yourself, morning, or nighttime.\r\n=&gt; If using with your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin, eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the mask’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply a thick layer of the mask on your face and neck, while always avoiding the eye contour area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Leave on for<strong> 5 minutes</strong>.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Humidify the mask with your wet hands and gently massage your face with circular movements for a few seconds before rinsing.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Abundantly rinse off with lukewarm water.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 6: [Important and shouldn’t be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:540:\"<strong>SAGE, PEPPERMINT, TEA TREE ESSENTIAL OILS</strong> – Unclog and tighten pores, refresh\r\n<strong>PURIFYING COMPLEX</strong> – Anti-bacterial, anti-inflammatory\r\n<strong>GREEN AND WHITE CLAY</strong> – Absorbs oil and impurities\r\n<strong>BURDOCK EXTRACT</strong> – Eliminate toxins, mattify\r\n<strong>PLANKTON</strong> – Energizes\r\n<strong>JOJOBA OIL</strong> – Soothes redness\r\n<strong>VITAMINE E</strong> – Antioxidant\r\n<strong>BIOTINE, VITAMIN B8</strong> – Anti-inflammatory\r\n<strong>ZINC</strong> – Helps to heal\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:882:\"AQUA / WATER / EAU, KAOLIN, ILLITE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM SILICATE, MALTODEXTRIN, GLYCERYL STEARATE, GLYCERIN, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, ISOPROPYL PALMITATE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, PLANKTON EXTRACT, TITANIUM DIOXIDE, SIMMONDSIA CHINENSIS (JOJOBA) SEED OIL, ZINC OXIDE, CETEARETH-20, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, XANTHAN GUM, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, DISODIUM EDTA, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, PYRIDOXINE HCL, MENTHA PIPERITA OIL/MENTHA PIPERITA (PEPPERMINT) OIL, MELALEUCA ALTERNIFOLIA (TEA TREE) LEAF OIL, COCAMIDOPROPYL PG-DIMONIUM CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE, SALVIA OFFICINALIS (SAGE) OIL, PHENETHYL ALCOHOL, ARCTIUM MAJUS ROOT EXTRACT, BIOSACCHARIDE GUM-1, GLYCERYL CAPRYLATE, SODIUM ANISATE, SODIUM LEVULINATE, SODIUM CITRATE, BIOTIN, ZINCPCA, CARBOMER, CITRICACID, NORDIHYDROGUAIARETIC ACID, OLEANOLIC ACID, SODIUM METABISULFITE\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
