(9011, 32235, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:3:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"How to use your soothing mask?\";s:7:\"content\";s:1017:\"For an unparalleled softness, use daily or at least 2 to 3 times a week whenever you put time aside for yourself, morning, or nighttime.\r\n\r\n=&gt; If using with your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin, eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the mask’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> Apply a thick layer of the mask on your face and neck, while always avoiding the eye contour area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Leave on for <strong>5 minutes</strong>.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Humidify the mask with your wet hands and gently massage your face with circular movements for a few seconds before rinsing.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Abundantly rinse off with lukewarm water.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 6: [Important and shouldn’t be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:304:\"<strong>ESSENTIAL FLOWERS WAXES (ACACIA, NARCISSUS, ROSE)</strong> – Soothe, soften, protect\r\n<strong> HORSE CHESTNUT EXTRACT</strong> – Soothes, de-puffs\r\n<strong>ALOE BARBADENIS</strong> – Soothes\r\n<strong>KAOLIN</strong> – Smoothes\r\n<strong>VEGETABLE GLYCERIN</strong> – Moisturizes, softens\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:705:\"INGREDIENTS: AQUA (WATER), KAOLIN, TALC, GLYCERIN, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, MAGNESIUM ALUMINIUM SILICATE, CAPRYLIC-CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, ISOPROPYL PALMITATE, LECITHIN, ALOE BARBADENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, ACACIA FARNESIANA FLOWER CERA, NARCISSUS POETICUS FLOWER CERA, ROSA CENTIFOLIA FLOWER CERA, ROSA DALASCENA FLOWER CERA, AESCULUS HIPPOCASTANUM, ALLANTOIN, CITRIC ACID, TITANIUM DIOXIDE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, DOLOMITE, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, XANTHAN GUM, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, LEVULINIC ACID, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, PHENETHYL ALCOHOL, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER, O-CYMEN-5-OL, SQUALANE, COCAMIDOPROPYL PGDIMONIUM CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE, POLYSORBATE 60, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
