(9023, 32236, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Description\";s:7:\"content\";s:291:\"The moisturizing fluid will bring out the glow and vitality of normal to combination skin. Thanks to its melting and non oily texture, this face fluid  perfectly hydrates and protects your skin, throughout the day. Enriched with 4 vitamins, it will plump, rebalance and revitalize your skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:27:\"How to apply your skincare?\";s:7:\"content\";s:581:\"<strong>In the morning:</strong>\r\n\r\nIn the morning:\r\nStep 1 <strong>Prepare your skin</strong>\r\n\r\n&gt;Splash fresh water to wake-up your senses.\r\n\r\n&gt;On dry skin, generously apply your personalized balancing active lotion. A prerequisite to rebalance your skin’s pH before further treatment (product available in our skincare line. Order separately.)\r\n\r\nStep 2 <strong>Apply your serum</strong>\r\n\r\nStep 3 <strong>The Multivitamin moisturizing fluid</strong>\r\n\r\n&gt;Apply 1 to 2 pumps of the cream on your face, neck and  décolleté, with gentle inside-out and upwards motions.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:49:\"Why less cleansing is better for your skin in mor\";s:7:\"content\";s:624:\"It is important to respect cutaneous balance while regulating the epidermis. Sebum is essential to your skin’s health, protecting it and maintaining its flora.\r\n\r\nCleansing it too frequently [hyper-hygienic] can disrupt the cutaneous balance. It removes the protective layer of sebum which stimulates the skin to reproduce an excess amount to protect itself, creating a vicious cycle.\r\n\r\nDuring the night and thanks to your night regiment, your skin remains clean throughout your bedtime. Splash fresh cold water to wake up your senses is all you need in the morning, also stimulating your skin’s blood microcirculation.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:333:\"PROVITAMIN B5 – Maintains skin hydration\r\nVITAMIN C/E – Antioxidant, energize and helps reduce imperfections\r\nVITAMIN A (RETINYL PALMITATE) – Smooths, boosts radiance\r\nVEGETABLE GLYCERIN – Moisturizes\r\nLICORICE ROOT EXTRACT – Anti-inflammatory\r\nSUN FLOWER OIL – Antioxidant, moisturizes, regenerates\r\nCORN OIL – Soothes\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:509:\"AQUA / WATER / EAU, GLYCERIN, ISOPROPYL PALMITATE, ZEA MAYS (CORN) OIL, CETYL ALCOHOL, SORBITOL, STEARETH-21, GLYCERYL STEARATE, PARFUM /FRAGRANCE , DIMETHICONE, PANTHENOL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, CARBOMER, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, HYDROXYETHYLCELLULOSE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, SODIUM ASCORBYL PHOSPHATE, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, DIPOTASSIUM GLYCYRRHIZATE, DISODIUM EDTA, COCAMIDOPROPYL PG-DIMONIUM CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE, RETINYL PALMITATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, TOCOPHEROL.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
