(9057, 32245, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:4:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Description\";s:7:\"content\";s:449:\"Developed for professional care, the ultimate face cream’s micro texture galenic formulation, provides its benefits with a sensual touch and feel.\r\n\r\nThis cream is a milestone of global anti-aging face creams. Its formula is enriched with powerful anti-aging ingredients for a smooth, plumped, firm and luminous skin. It prolongs the serum’s action by improving the skin’s suppleness and elasticity as well as protecting it throughout the day.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:31:\"How to use your ultimate cream?\";s:7:\"content\";s:468:\"<strong>Your morning anti-aging routine:</strong>\r\n\r\nStep 1 <strong>Active lotion</strong> – generously apply your personalized balancing active lotion. A prerequisite to rebalance your skin’s pH before further treatment (product available in our skincare line. Order separately.)\r\n\r\nStep 3 <strong>Apply your daytime serum</strong>\r\n\r\nStep 4 <strong>Ultimate face cream</strong>\r\n\r\n&gt;Apply ultimate face cream to face, neck and décolleté, inside-out, upwards.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:676:\"SQUALANE (OBTAINED FROM SUGAR CANE) – Improves skin elasticity and softness, smoothes, moisturizes\r\nOLIGOPEPTIDE (FROM BEE WAXE) – Stimulates collagen production for a complete anti-aging action\r\nORGANIC SILICIUM – Restructurates, regenerates\r\nSPILANTHES ACMELLA FLOWER EXTRACT – Improves firmness and density, smoothes wrinkles\r\nANTI-DARK SPOTS ACTIVE – Lightens and unifies the skin\r\nPLANTAGO LANCEOLATA LEAF EXTRACT – anti-dark spots action, tonifies, smoothes\r\nHYALURONIC ACID – Moisturizes, plumps the skin\r\nXIMENIA SEED OIL – Nourishes, repairs, protects\r\nSHEA BUTTER – Nourishes, soothes, repairs, softens, protects\r\nVEGETABLE GLYCERIN – Moisturizes\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:954:\"AQUA (WATER), CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, GLYCERIN, CETEARYL ETHYLHEXANOATE, CETYL ALCOHOL, SQUALANE, POLYGLYCERYL-6 DISTEARATE, XIMENIA AMERICANA SEED OIL, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, DIMETHICONE,GLYCERYL BEHENATE,METHYLPROPANEDIOL, PLANTAGO LANCEOLATA LEAF EXTRACT, HYDROLYZED HYALURONIC ACID, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, SPILANTHES ACMELLA FLOWER EXTRACT, SQUALENE, JOJOBA ESTERS, PALMITOYL TRIPEPTIDE-1, PALMITOYL OLIGOPEPTIDE, PALMITOYL TETRAPEPTIDE-7, BETA-SITOSTEROL, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, POLYGLYCERYL-3 BEESWAX, SODIUM STEAROYL GLUTAMATE, PROPANEDIOL, TOCOPHEROL, XANTHAN GUM, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, PHENYLPROPANOL, CITRIC ACID, METHYLSILANOL MANNURONATE, GLYCOLIC ACID, LACTIC ACID, SODIUM LACTATE, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), BUTYLENE GLYCOL, SODIUM POLY ACRYLATE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE COPOLYMER, CARBOMER, POLYSORBATE 60, POLYSORBATE 20, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, POLYVINYL ALCOHOL.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
