(9066, 32247, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Description\";s:7:\"content\";s:632:\"A unique synergy of 8 active ingredients revives the skin’s natural functions. This approach delivers impressive results by maximizing the effectiveness of each active ingredient.\r\n\r\nThe bioavailability of its haute-cosmétique emulsion allows the active ingredients to work almost instantaneously and to maximum potency.\r\n\r\nThanks to its synergistic action, the essential firming serum delivers measurable, visible results. With every application(3), it makes skin firmer, smoother and gravity defying.\r\n\r\nWith this level of excellence and performance, the essential firming serum sets standards in the quest for timeless beauty.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Active Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:1284:\"<strong>Active Ingredients – Formulated at the maximum recommended %.</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>1. Matrixyl Morphomics™ (2%)</strong> – Peptides\r\n&gt; Stimulates collagen production for firmer skin.\r\n\r\n<strong>2. Majestem™ (2%)</strong> – Edelweiss plant cell cultures.\r\n&gt; Reshapes the neck and oval of the face thanks to its anti-gravity action\r\n\r\n<strong>3. Idealift™ (4%)</strong> – Natural lipopeptides (Tyr-Arg).\r\n&gt; Increases elasticity by stimulating the synthesis of elastin fibers.\r\n\r\n<strong>4. NovoRetin™ (3 %)</strong> – Pistachio mastic resin (Chios, Greece).\r\n&gt; Provides «retinol-like» action without side effects.\r\n&gt; Refines pores and provides a lifting effect.\r\n\r\n<strong>5. Liftonin Xpress™ (2 %)</strong> – Porphyridium cruentum red algae.\r\n&gt; Immediate smoothing of wrinkles with tensor effect in seconds.\r\n\r\n<strong>6. Adeplump™ (1%)</strong> – Arnica Montana flower extract.\r\n&gt; Replumps adipose tissue to redefine the oval of the face.\r\n\r\n<strong>7. Aquaxyl™ (3%)</strong> – A complex of natural sugars.\r\n&gt; Deeply moisturizes by strengthening the skin’s barrier function.\r\n\r\n<strong>8. Mirabelle (1,5%) and Chicory (1%) oils .</strong>\r\n&gt; Nourish and repair the skin while providing a powerful antioxidant action.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:32:\"How to apply your firming serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:885:\"Use daily at nighttime or if in the morning before your face cream.\r\n=&gt; If using during your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> [Important and should not be skipped] Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply the full dose of your serum onto your face, eye contour, neck and décolleté.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply the next step of your routine (either a night mask or face cream).\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:580:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum than release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, eye contour, neck and décolleté on a cleansed and pH rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:820:\"Aqua, butylène glycol, alcane C15-19, pentylène glycol, glycérine, alcool isostéarylique, huile de graines de Prunus domestica, cocoate de butylène glycol, xylitylglucoside, hydroxypropylméthylcellulose, huile de graines de Cichorium intybus, anhydroxylitol, pullulane, extrait de culture de cal de Leontopodium alpinum, triglycéride caprylique/caprique, xylitol, polyacrylate crosspolymer-6, phénylpropanol, laurate de sorbitan, glucose, éthylcellulose, gomme de pistachier lentiscus, lécithine, extrait de Porphyridium cruentum, hydroxyéthylcellulose, acétyl dipeptide-1 cétyle ester, hydroxyde de sodium, extrait de fleur d’Arnica Montana, caprylyl glycol, acétate de NProlyl Palmitoyl Tripeptide-56, huile de graines d’Helianthus annuus, gomme xanthane, tocophérol, Caprylate/Caprate de glycéryle\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
