(9074, 32253, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:6:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Benefits\";s:7:\"content\";s:1068:\"Cutaneous aging can be accelerated with our life habits. An unbalanced level of free radicals in the body, due to sun exposure, stress level, eating habits or smoking can accelerate the cells’ oxidation. This oxidation is responsible for the loss of moisture, suppleness and firmness of the skin. 4 out of 5 wrinkles appear due to this phenomenon.\r\n\r\nThe natural function of the vitamin E is to neutralize and limit the overgrowth of free radicals and consequently protect skin cells from oxidation. It also contributes to strengthen the skin’s hydrolipidic film which is key to maintain a healthy moisture level of skin cells. This process ultimately slows down the signs of aging.\r\n\r\nThe vitamin E is, therefore, a daily necessity to protect and preserve a youthful skin as long as possible. The Gisele Delorme antioxidant serum, thanks to its unique hydro and liposoluble formula, provides a remarkable bioavailability of the vitamin E’s incredible qualities and benefits to your skin. This complex allows a deeper treatment and protection throughout the day.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Result\";s:7:\"content\";s:194:\"Thanks to its concentration, the vitaminic complex serum is your best ally to supplement and energize your skin against cutaneous aging. Rediscover a luminous, supple, smoothed and soothed skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:42:\"How to apply your vitaminic complex serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:904:\"Use daily at nighttime or if in the morning before your face cream.\r\n=&gt; If using during your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> [Important and should not be skipped] Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply the full dose of your serum onto your face, neck and décolleté, while avoiding the eye contour.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply the next step of your routine (either a night mask or face cream).\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:603:\"The optimal dose of serum for each application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, empty the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum then release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Empty the entire amount of vacuumed serum in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply your serum on your face, neck and décolleté, while always avoiding the eye contour, on a cleansed and rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:259:\"<strong>VITAMIN E (5%):</strong>\r\n Protects against free radicals (UV, pollution, stress, tobacco…)\r\n Eliminates signs of fatigue\r\n Maintains the skin’s moisture level\r\n Promotes cell regeneration\r\n Improves the efficiency of products subsequently applied\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:265:\"AQUA / WATER / EAU, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, PEG-35 CASTOR OIL, TRIDECETH-9, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL PG-DIMONIUM, CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE, CITRIC ACID.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
