(9082, 32255, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:42:\"How to use your purifying essential serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:904:\"Use daily at nighttime or if in the morning before your face cream.\r\n=&gt; If using during your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply the full dose of your serum onto your face, neck and décolleté, while avoiding the eye contour.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply the next step of your routine (either a night mask or face cream).\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:605:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum than release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong>  Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, neck and décolleté while avoiding the eye contour area on a cleansed and pH rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"Why less cleansing is better for your skin in mor.\";s:7:\"content\";s:631:\"With a combination skin, it is important to respect the cutaneous balance while regulating the epidermis. Sebum is essential to your skin’s health, protecting it and maintaining its flora.\r\n\r\nCleansing it too frequently [hyper-hygienic] can disrupt the cutaneous balance. It removes the protective layer of sebum, stimulating the skin to reproduce an excess amount to protect itself, creating a vicious cycle.\r\n\r\nDuring the night and thanks to your night regiment, your skin remains clean throughout your bedtime. Fresh cold water to wake up your senses is sufficient and will also stimulate your skin’s blood microcirculation.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:535:\"ANTI-ACNE COMPLEX – Regulates and purifies\r\n PURIFYING COMPLEX – Absorbs impurities and excess sebum\r\n HYALURONIC ACID – Moisturizes\r\n BURDOCK EXTRACT – Eliminates toxins and mattifies the skin\r\n ESSENTIAL OILS (SAGE, PEPPERMINT, TEA TREE) – Scrubs and tightens pores while refreshing the\r\n complexion\r\n PLANKTON – Revitalizes, stimulates, anti-inflammatory\r\n PROVITAMIN B5 – Maintains skin hydration\r\n BIOTINE, VITAMIN B8 – Anti-inflammatory\r\n ZINC – Helps healing process\r\n\r\nParaben-, alcohol- and mineral oil- free\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:858:\"AQUA (WATER), PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, MALTODEXTRIN, GLYCERIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, POLYSORBATE 60, CANDIDA BOMBICOLA/GLUCOSE/METHYL RAPESEEDATE FERMENT, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), PANTHENOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, METHYLPROPANEDIOL, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, XANTHAN GUM, ZINC GLUCONATE, ARCTIUM MAJUS EXTRACT, HYDROLYZED ALGIN, COCAMIDOPROPYL PG-DIMONIUM CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE, AMMONIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYLTAURATE/VP COPOLYMER, MENTHA PIPERITA (PEPPERMINT) OIL, MELALEUCA ALTERNIFOLIA (TEA TREE) LEAF OIL, PYRIDOXINE HCL, SALVIA OFFICINALIS (SAGE) OIL, PHENETHYL ALCOHOL, PLANKTON EXTRACT, ZINC SULFATE, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SODIUM HYALURONATE, METHYLSILANOL MANNURONATE, PANTOLACTONE, BIOTIN, CARBOMER, NORDIHYDROGUAIARETIC ACID, OLEANOLIC ACID, SODIUM METABISULFITE, CI 19140, CI 42090, LIMONENE, ALPHA ISOMETHYL IONONE, LINALOOL, CITRONELLOL.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
