(9090, 32257, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:6:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Beauty results\";s:7:\"content\";s:208:\"– The skin is filled in with the best of nature\r\n– The skin is repaired, renovated, it recovers optimal comfort and vitality\r\n– Facial lines are smoothed out and skin recovers its original youthful glow\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Key actives (100%)\";s:7:\"content\";s:773:\"<strong>– Hemp oil (38%):</strong> Regenerating, anti-free radicals, revitalizing\r\n<strong> – Apricot kernel oil (36%) :</strong> Hydrating, regenerating, softening\r\n<strong> – Evening primrose oil (7,52%):</strong> Anti-wrinkle, regenerating\r\n<strong> – Borage oil (6,3%) :</strong> Regenerating, nourishing, softening, protecting\r\n<strong> – Centella asiatica extract ( 5 % ):</strong> Anti-aging, anti-free radicals\r\n<strong> – Vitaminic complex (vitamins A, E and F) (6,25%):</strong> Anti-aging, repairing, antioxidant\r\n<strong> – Essential oils (vervain, sage, lemon catnip, Roman chamomile) (0,8%):</strong> Calming, repairing\r\n<strong> – Garrot oleoresin (0,03%):</strong> Softening, regenerating\r\n<strong> – Oxynex K (0,1%) :</strong> Antioxidant\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:39:\"Proven efficacy of our selected actives\";s:7:\"content\";s:1388:\"<strong>– Hemp oil :</strong> contains one of the highest levels of essential fatty acids and gamma­linolenic acid. lt also contains vitamins A, B1, B3, B4, B6 and E and has an ideal ratio between omega-3 and omega-6.\r\n\r\n<strong> – Apricot kernel oil :</strong> rich in vitamin A, linoleic acid, polyunsaturated acids and minerais. Moisturizing and regenerating, it softens sensitive and prematurely aged skin.\r\n\r\n<strong> – Evening primrose oil :</strong> rich in vitamin E and essential fatty acids, it contributes to a positive effect on the regeneration of the skin. Known for its anti-wrinkle properties, it restores balance to the skin and regenerates.\r\n\r\n<strong> – Borage oil :</strong> composed of a high rate of polyunsaturated essential fatty acids (linoleic acid and gamma-linoleic), it has unique regenerating, nourishing, softening, protective and anti-aging properties.\r\n\r\n<strong> – Centella asiatica extract:</strong> traditionally used for its healing and soothing properties, this plant extract is selected for its high content in unsaponifiable, known for their ability to protect the skin from aging.\r\n\r\n<strong> – Vitaminic complex (vitamins A, E and F) :</strong> stimulates cell renewal, inhibits the oxidation of cells and tissues, stimulates the synthesis of lipids in the cells and increases the resistance of the skin against external aggressions.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:33:\"How to use your nourishing serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:906:\"Use daily at nighttime or if in the morning before your face cream.\r\n=&gt; If using during your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply the full dose* of your serum onto your face, neck and décolleté, while avoiding the eye contour.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply the next step of your routine (either a night mask or face cream)..\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:605:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum than release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong>  Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, neck and décolleté while avoiding the eye contour area on a cleansed and pH rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:667:\"CANNABIS SATIVA SEED OIL, PRUNUS ARMENIACA (APRICOT) KERNEL OIL, OENOTHERA BIENNIS (EVENING PRIMROSE) OIL, BORAGO OFFICINALIS SEED OIL, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED OIL, LINOLEIC ACID, BETA-SITOSTEROL, PASSIFLORA EDULIS SEED OIL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, CENTELLA ASIATICA EXTRACT, OLEIC ACID, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, PARFUM (FRAGANCE), NEPETA CATARIA OIL, SALVIA OFFICINALIS (SAGE) OIL, PALMITIC ACID, CITRAL, ANTHEMIS NOBILIS FLOWER OIL, RETINYL PALMITATE, TOCOPHEROL, STEARIC ACID, GERANIOL, LIMONENE, CITRONELLOL, LINOLENIC ACID, SQUALENE, LINALOOL, BENZYL BENZOATE, DAUCUS CAROTA SATIVA (CARROT) ROOT EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF EXTRACT.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
