(9106, 32262, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:4:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:31:\"How to use your soothing serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:904:\"Use daily at nighttime or if in the morning before your face cream.\r\n=&gt; If using during your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply the full dose of your serum onto your face, neck and décolleté, while avoiding the eye contour.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply the next step of your routine (either a night mask or face cream).\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:605:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum than release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong>  Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, neck and décolleté while avoiding the eye contour area on a cleansed and pH rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:641:\"<strong>ESSENTIAL FLOWER WAXES (ROSE, ACACIA, NARCISSUS)</strong>- Sooth, soften, protect\r\n<strong>RELAXING COMPLEX (LIPOPEPTIDE)</strong> – Desensitizes\r\n<strong>HORSE CHESTNUT EXTRACT</strong> – De-puffs, anti-couperosis\r\n<strong>ORGANIC SILICIUM</strong> – Restructurates, regenerates\r\n<strong>JUJUBE FRUIT EXTRACT</strong> – Anti-allergic action\r\n<strong>VITAMIN E</strong> – Antioxidant\r\n<strong>HYALURONIC ACID</strong> – Moisturizes, plumps the skin\r\n<strong>VEGETABLE BISABOLOL</strong> – Calms, soothes, anti-inflammatory\r\n<strong>VEGETABLE GLYCERIN</strong> – Moisturizes\r\n\r\nParaben-, alcohol- and mineral oil- free\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:397:\"AQUA / WATER / EAU, GLYCERIN POLYSORBATE 20, BISABOLOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, SQUALANE, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, METHYLPROPANED OIL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, AESCULUS HIPPOCASTANUM SEED EXTRACT / AESCULUS HIPPOCASTANUM (HORSE CHESTNUT) SEED EXTRACT, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, XANTHAN GUM, DIPOTASSIUM GLYCYRRHIZATE,\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
