(9115, 32264, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:7:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Dehydration, what to look for?\";s:7:\"content\";s:1039:\"Surface dehydration is a crippling enemy of the skin affecting up to 98% of the populations in varying degrees, and is associated with problems as diverse as scaly, taut skin, superficial lines and prema­ture aging.\r\n\r\n<strong>How to recognize a dehydrated skin?</strong>\r\nSorne symptoms of dehydrated skin include a tight feeling to the skin, especially after bathing or taking a shower. Dehydrated skin can appear to be shrivelled up, with little elasticity. Skin that no longer appears smooth in appearance, but rough, may be dehydrated. Often, a sign of dehydrated skin may be an incessant itching, which can even become painful.\r\n\r\n<strong>What could be the causes of dehydration ?</strong>\r\nThey can be of various origins. : environmental factors (pollution, air-cond … ), climate (wind, temperature variations, sun … ). A state of tiredness, stress or hormonal imbalance may also be a source of dehydration, as well as natural aging process.\r\nFor more information on how to diagnose dehydrated skin: read the following article:\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Benefits\";s:7:\"content\";s:811:\"This serum gets its moisturizing virtues from the laminaria seaweed. Concentrated in minerals and oligo-elements from seawater, they provide fundamental active elements to the skin. Also known as the seaweed of youth, thanks to its soothing, mineral-restoring and moisturizing qualities, the epidermis gets the right amount of hydration. Your skin is deeply moisturized, plumped, and its natural radiance is restored. Fines lines, due to dehydration, have faded.\r\n\r\n\r\nTo ensure a highly potent formula, sarsaparilla and white willow extracts were combined with the laminaria seaweed. The white willow extract stimulates and tones the epidermis reducing fine line. Lastly, the sarsaparilla extract, thanks to its anti-inflammatory and regenerating virtues, allows the skin to regain it natural glow and vitality.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Result\";s:7:\"content\";s:264:\"A lifeline for dehydrated skin, this powerful concentrate reinvigorates your skin as if saturated with moisture. It is ideally plumped and re-energized. Sensations of tightness disappear. Your skin regains elasticity, suppleness, and an instant relief and comfort.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:37:\"How to apply your moisturizing serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:905:\"Use daily at nighttime or if in the morning before your face cream.\r\n=&gt; If using during your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply the full dose* of your serum onto your face, neck and décolleté, while avoiding the eye contour.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply the next step of your routine (either a night mask or face cream).\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:605:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum than release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong>  Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, neck and décolleté while avoiding the eye contour area on a cleansed and pH rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:1200:\"<strong>LAMINARIA DIGITATA SEAWEED</strong> – Marine origin active with ultra-hydrating properties. Rich in amino-acids, trace-elements, minerai salts … it remineralizes and repulps the epidermis.\r\n\r\n<strong>SARSAPARILLA EXTRACT</strong> – Vegetable active with anti-inflammatory and stimulating properties.\r\n\r\n<strong>WHITE WILLOW POLYPHENOL EXTRACT</strong> – Polyphenols with high protecting and stimulating properties. They help skin to protect itself against external aggressions and to recover vital balance.\r\n\r\n<strong>GERANIUM ESSENTIAL OIL</strong> – Regenerating and repairing action, contributes to soften wrinkles and fine lines.\r\n\r\n<strong>ROSEMARY ESSENTIAL OIL</strong> – Stimulating and tonifying action.\r\n\r\n<strong>NIAOULI ESSENTIAL OIL</strong> – Regenerating and repairing action.\r\n\r\n<strong>CLOVE ESSENTIAL OIL</strong> – Purifying and anti-bacterial action.\r\n\r\n<strong>AJEPUT ESSENTIAL OIL</strong> – Anti-inflammatory and calming action.\r\n\r\n<strong>LAVANDER ESSENTIAL OIL</strong> – Relaxing and calming action.\r\n\r\n<strong>SWEET ALMOND OIL</strong> – Moisturizes, softens, soothes.\r\n\r\nFormula free of alcohol, paraben, minerai oil and artificial fragrance.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:581:\"AQUA / WATER / EAU, PEG-7 GLYCERYL COCOATE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, GLYCERIN, ALGAE EXTRACT, BENZYL ALCOHOL, SALIX ALBA (WILLOW BARK) EXTRACT, SMILAX MEDICA ROOT EXTRACT, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY) LEAF OIL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, MELALEUCA VIRIDIFLORA LEAF OIL, MELALEUCA LEUCADENDRON CAJAPUTI OIL, EUGENOL, LAVANDULA ANGUSTIFOLIA (LAVENDER) OIL, LINALOOL, CITRONELLOL, PELARGONIUM GRAVEOLENS FLOWER OIL, LIMONENE, GERANIOL, CITRIC ACID, EUGENIA CARYOPHYLLUS (CLOVE) BUD OIL, SODIUM BENZOATE, CITRAL, CI 19140 / YELLOW 5, CI 14700 /RED 4, CI 17200 / RED 33.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
