(9124, 32266, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:6:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:17:\"Loss of radiance?\";s:7:\"content\";s:429:\"From the age of 30, cellular resources of the skin begin to decrease.\r\nThe condition of the skin surface and its ability to reflect light depends on many factors including the regularity and consistency of skin’s cells.\r\nSkin aging starts to be visible, even before the appearance of wrinkles, through the loss of brightness and luminosity.\r\nSkin looks devitalized, its texture becomes less smooth, the complexion becomes dull.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Beauty results\";s:7:\"content\";s:184:\"– The complexion recovers its luminous glow\r\n– The skin is retexturized, skin texture is refined\r\n– The tissues are renovated, the skin is redensified, oxygenated and revitalized\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:38:\"How to use your glow renovating serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:902:\"Use daily at nighttime or if in the morning before your face cream.\r\n=&gt; If using during your morning routine, awaken your senses with fresh water and skip to step 2.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply the full dose of your serum onto your face, neck and décolleté, while avoiding the eye contour.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n<strong>Step 5:</strong> Apply the next step of your routine (either a night mask or face cream).\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:605:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum than release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3: </strong> Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, neck and décolleté while avoiding the eye contour area on a cleansed and pH rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:758:\"PRINCIPAL ACTIVES (20,77%):\r\n\r\n<strong>– A.H.A natural fruit extracts (5%)</strong> – apricot, strawberry, raspberry, guava, mango, grapefruit, peach and passion fruit: Retexturizing, exfoliates, cellular renewal.\r\n\r\n<strong>– NG Kombuchka® – Black tea ferment (3%):</strong> Boosts radiance, anti-wrinkle, redensifying\r\n\r\n<strong>–Phylderm® Vegetal C2 – hydrolyzed soy protein (5%):</strong> Revitalizing, biostimulating, oxygenating.\r\n\r\n<strong>– Green tea polyphenols (0,1%):</strong>  Anti-aging, antioxidant.\r\n\r\n<strong>– Vitamin A (0,07%):</strong> Anti-aging, anti-free radicals.\r\n\r\n<strong>– Hydrating active complex (7,5%):</strong> Hydration, skin comfort.\r\n\r\n<strong>– Allantoin (0,1%) : </strong>Soothing, anti-inflammatory.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:1006:\"INGREDIENTS: AQUA / WATER / EAU, PEG-8 CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC GLYCERIDES, PROPYLENEGLYCOL, GLYCERIN, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, SACCHAROMYCES/XYLINUM/BLACK TEA FERMENT, ETHOXYDIGLYCOL, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, BENZYL ALCOHOL, BENZOPHENONE-4, POTASSIUM SORBATE, XANTHAN GUM, CITRUS GRANDIS (GRAPEFRUIT) FRUIT EXTRACT, FRAGARIA VESCA (STRAWBERRY) FRUIT EXTRACT, GLYCOLIC ACID, MANGIFERA INDICA (MANGO) FRUIT EXTRACT, PASSIFLORA INCARNATA FRUIT EXTRACT, PRUNUS ARMENIACA (APRICOT) FRUIT EXTRACT, PRUNUS PERSICA (PEACH) FRUIT EXTRACT, PSIDIUM GUAJAVA FRUIT EXTRACT, RUBUS IDAEUS (RASPBERRY) FRUIT EXTRACT, CAMELLIA SINENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, ALLANTOIN, CITRIC ACID, PHENETHYL ALCOHOL, TRIETHANOLAMINE, PARFUM / FRAGRANCE, LACTIC ACID, HYDROXYETHYLCELLULOSE, RETINYL PALMITATE, ARACHIS HYPOGAEA (PEANUT) OIL, BENZOIC ACID, MANDELIC ACID, SORBIC ACID, HEXYL CINNAMAL, HYDROXYISOHEXYL 3-CYCLOHEXENE CARBOXALDEHYDE, ALPHA-ISOMETHYL IONONE, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL, BENZYL SALICYLATE, CI 14700 / RED 4, TOCOPHEROL, CI 17200 / RED 33.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
