(9144, 32268, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:6:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Benefits\";s:7:\"content\";s:693:\"Thanks to the know-how of Gisèle Delorme’s research, the detox arom’activ serum is a pure synergy from the benefits of herbal therapy (6%), aromatherapy (4%) and gemmotherapy (3%).\r\n\r\nThis energy blend is formulated with two plant extracts (burdock and hop) that regulate the epidermis, 5 essential oils (cypress, thyme, sage, eucalyptus, peppermint) with purifying and stimulating benefits and soy protein hydrolysate boosting cellular regeneration. The castor and sweet almond oils allow the serum to be both water and fat soluble. This provides a remarkable bio availability of its formula’s benefits.\r\n\r\nThis serum is applied in its pure form, for a deeper nighttime skin treatment.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Result\";s:7:\"content\";s:181:\"Wake up to a purified and refreshed skin. When applied daily, the excess sebum produced by the epidermis is regulated and reduced and pores tightened. The skin regains its radiance.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:39:\"How to use your detox arom\'activ serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:1069:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\nThis serum should only be used at night to avoid photosynthesis risks (contains essential oils).\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply a full dose of your arom’activ detox serum on your face, neck and décolleté while always avoiding the eye contour area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5: [Optional but highly recommended]</strong> To ensure an unparalleled skin comfort when waking up, apply at nighttime a full dose of moisturizing essential serum with your arom’activ serum.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:602:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum then release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:  </strong>Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, neck and décolleté while avoiding the eye contour area on a cleansed and rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:562:\"PHYTOTHERAPY (6%)\r\n<strong>Burdock extract</strong> Eliminates toxins, regulates, mattifies.\r\n<strong>Hop extract</strong> Regulates sebum production and skin imbalance, stimulates cell renewal.\r\n\r\nAROMATHERAPY (4%)\r\n<strong>Essential oils</strong> [cypress, thyme, sage, eucalyptus, peppermint] eliminate toxins and deep cleanse pores, stimulate cell renewal, refresh.\r\n\r\nGEMMOTHERAPY (3%)\r\n<strong>Hydrolyzed soy protein</strong> boosts oxygen consumption and cellular renewal.\r\n\r\nVEGETABLE BASE\r\n<strong>Sweet almond and castor oils</strong> nourish the skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:540:\"AQUA / WATER / EAU, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL. TRIDECETH-9, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, GLYCERIN, SALVIA OFFICINALIS (SAGE) OIL, CUPRESSUS SEMPERVIRENS OIL, THYMUS VULGARIS (THYME) FLOWER/LEAF OIL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, MENTHA PIPERITA (PEPPERMINT) OIL, EUCALYPTUS GLOBULUS LEAF OIL, HUMULUS LUPULUS (HOPS) CONE EXTRACT, POTASSIUM SORBATE, LIMONENE, LINALOOL, CITRIC ACID, ARCTIUM MAJUS ROOT EXTRACT, BENZOIC ACID, SODIUM BENZOATE, BIOTIN, SORBIC ACID, ZINC PCA.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
