(9152, 32270, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:6:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Benefits\";s:7:\"content\";s:741:\"Thanks to the know-how of Gisèle Delorme’s research, the arom’activ repair serum is a pure synergy from the benefits of herbal therapy (6%), aromatherapy (4%) and gemmotherapy (3%).\r\n\r\nThis energy blend is formulated with two plants extracts (white willow and sarsaparilla) that tone and purify the epidermis, 6 essential oils (clove, rosemary, geranium, niaouli, lavender, cajeput) with calming, soothing and protecting benefits, and finally hydrolyzed soy protein boosting cellular regeneration. The castor and sweet almond oils allow the serum to be both water and fat soluble. Thus, provides a remarkable bio availability of its formula’s benefits.\r\n\r\nThis serum is applied in its pure form, for a deeper nighttime skin treatment.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Result\";s:7:\"content\";s:219:\"Wake up to a soothed and souple skin. When applied daily, the serum will promote a healthier cellular regeneration while protecting your epidermis. Your skin is much less sensitive and regains its vitality and radiance.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:40:\"How to use your repair arom\'activ serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:1070:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\nThis serum should only be used at night to avoid photosynthesis risks (contains essential oils).\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply a full dose of your arom’activ repair serum on your face, neck and décolleté while always avoiding the eye contour area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5: [Optional but highly recommended]</strong> To ensure an unparalleled skin comfort when waking up, apply at nighttime a full dose of moisturizing essential serum with your arom’activ serum.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:602:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum then release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong>  Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, neck and décolleté while avoiding the eye contour area on a cleansed and rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:472:\"PHYTOTHERAPY (6%)\r\n<strong>Sarsaparilla extract</strong> purifies and tones the skin.\r\nWhite willow extract tones the epidermis.\r\n\r\nAROMATHERAPY (4%)\r\n<strong>Essential oils</strong> [clove, rosemary, geranium, niaouli, lavender, cajeput] calm, purify, tone, protect, stimulate, sooth and repair.\r\n\r\nGEMMOTHERAPY (3%)\r\n<strong>Hydrolyzed soy</strong> protein boosts oxygen consumption and cellular renewal.\r\n\r\nVEGETABLE BASE\r\nSweet almond and castor oils nourish the skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:617:\"INGREDIENTS: AQUA / WATER / EAU. PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, TRIDECETH-9, GLYCERIN, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, ROSMARINUS OFFICINALIS (ROSEMARY), LEAF OIL, BENZYL ALCOHOL, MELALEUCA LEUCADENDRON CAJAPUTI OIL, MELALEUCA VIRIDIFLORA LEAF OIL, LAVANDULA ANGUSTIFOLIA (LAVENDER) OIL, LINALOOL, SALIX ALBA (WILLOW BARK) EXTRACT, SMILAX MEDICA ROOT EXTRACT, CITRONELLOL, PELARGONIUM GRAVEOLENS FLOWER OIL, LIMONENE, POTASSIUM SORBATE, GERANIOL, EUGENOL, CITRIC ACID, EUGENIA CARYOPHYLLUS (CLOVE] BUD OIL, BENZOIC ACID, CITRAL, SODIUM BENZOATE, SORBIC ACID.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
