(9160, 32272, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:6:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Benefits\";s:7:\"content\";s:731:\"Thanks to the know-how of Gisèle Delorme’s research, the arom’activ tonic serum is a pure synergy from the benefits of herbal therapy (6%), aromatherapy (4%) and gemmotherapy (3%).\r\n\r\nThis energy blend is formulated with two plants extracts (green tea and witch hazel) that stimulates the epidermis, 6 essential oils (ylang ylang, lemon, scots pine, sweet orange, clover, peppermint) with energizing and toning benefits, and finally hydrolyzed soy protein boosting cellular regeneration. The castor and sweet almond oils allow the serum to be both water and fat soluble. Thus, provides a remarkable bio availability of its formula’s benefits.\r\n\r\nThis serum is applied in its pure form, for a deeper nighttime skin treatment.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:6:\"Result\";s:7:\"content\";s:131:\"Wake up to a radiant skin. The veil of tiredness is reduced. When applied daily, your epidermis will regain firmness, and vitality.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:39:\"How to use your tonic arom\'activ serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:1069:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\nThis serum should only be used at night to avoid photosynthesis risks (contains essential oils).\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong> Cleanse your skin. Eliminate all impurities accumulated throughout the day to ensure a better absorption of the serum’s benefits.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2: [Important and should not be skipped]</strong> Prepare your skin to receive the next steps of your skincare routine by rebalancing its pH level with your personalized active lotion.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong> Apply a full dose of your arom’activ tonic serum on your face, neck and décolleté while always avoiding the eye contour area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Massage your skin delicately with inside out and upwards movements, until your skin has fully absorbed the serum.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 5: [Optional but highly recommended]</strong> To ensure an unparalleled skin comfort when waking up, apply at nighttime a full dose of moisturizing essential serum with your arom’activ serum.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:50:\"How much serum should you use for each application\";s:7:\"content\";s:602:\"The optimal dose of serum for every application is the full amount generated from a pipette squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 1:</strong>  Unscrew the pipette of your serum bottle, release the residual bubbles and drops with a squeeze.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 2:</strong> While maintaining pressure on the teat, submerge the pipette in the serum then release the pressure.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 3:</strong>  Empty the entire amount of serum vacuumed in the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n<strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply the serum on your face, neck and décolleté while avoiding the eye contour area on a cleansed and rebalanced skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Key Ingredient\";s:7:\"content\";s:533:\"PHYTOTHERAPY (6%)\r\n<strong>Witch hazel extract</strong> tones and firms the skin.\r\n<strong>Green tea extract</strong> with its antioxidant benefits, stimulates the epidermis.\r\n\r\n\r\nAROMATHERAPY (4%)\r\n<strong>Essential oils</strong> [ylang ylang, lemon, scotch pine, sweet orange, clove, peppermint] tone, revitalize and smooth the epidermis.\r\n\r\nGEMMOTHERAPY (3%)\r\n<strong>Hydrolyzed soy</strong> protein boosts oxygen consumption and cellular renewal.\r\n\r\nVEGETABLE BASE\r\n<strong>Castor and Sweet almond oils</strong> nourish the skin.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:660:\"INGREDIENTS: AQUA/WATER/EAU, PEG-60 ALMOND GLYCERIDES, PPG-26-BUTETH-26, PEG-40 HYDROGENATED CASTOR OIL, TRIDECETH-9, GLYCERIN, HYDROLYZED SOY PROTEIN, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, LIMONENE, MENTHA PIPERITA (PEPPERMINT) OIL, PINUS SYLVESTRIS LEAF OIL, BENZYL ALOCOHOL, CANANGA ODORATA FLOWER OIL, CAMELLIA SINENSIS LEAF EXTRACT, HAMAMELIS VIRGINIANA LEAF EXTRACT, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CITRUS MEDICA LIMONUM (LEMON) PEEL OIL, EUGENOL, CITRIC ACID, BENZYL BENZOATE. CITRAL EUGENIA CARYOPHYLLUS (CLOVE) BUD OIL, BENZYL SALICYTATE, LINALOOL, BENZOIC ACID, CITRUS AURANTIUM DULCIS (ORANGE) PEEL OIL, FARNESOL, SODIUM BENZOATE, GERANIOL, ISOEUGENOL, SORBIC ACID, CITRONELLOL.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
