(9168, 32274, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:4:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Description\";s:7:\"content\";s:335:\"An ultra-powerful and innovative eye care for uncompromising results. It fights all the signs of aging and helps reduce puffiness.  Thanks to its repulping action, the serum lifts, deeply hadrates for an immediate glowing gaze. Lines are visibly smoother after application.\r\n\r\nThe eyes contour is visibly relaxed, brighter and younger.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:34:\"How to use your revival eye serum?\";s:7:\"content\";s:666:\"<strong>Your morning routine:</strong>\r\n\r\nStep 1 Prepare your skin\r\n&gt;Splash fresh water to wake-up your senses.\r\n&gt;On dry skin, generously apply your personalized balancing active lotion. A prerequisite to rebalance your skin’s pH before further treatment (product available in our skincare line. Order separately.)\r\n\r\nSte 2 <strong>Revival eye serum</strong>\r\n&gt;Apply one pressure on the pump releasing a dose of serum on the tip of your finger.\r\n&gt;Apply serum delicately massaging the eye contour from inside-out in order to move excess serum away from eyes and smooth lines.\r\n\r\nStep 3 <strong>Apply your daytime serum and protective face cream</strong>\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:368:\"SILK TREE – Lifts sagging upper eye lids, reduces wrinkles, puffiness, dark circles and    brightens\r\nMATRIXYL 3000 – Smoothes wrinkles, lifts\r\nHORSE CHESTNUT EXTRACT – Fades dark circles\r\nPOLYLIFT – Lifts\r\nHYALURONIC ACID – Moisturizes\r\nCAFFEINE EXTRACT – Reduces puffiness\r\nSHEA BUTTER – Nourishes, softens, soothes, protects\r\nVITAMIN E – Antioxidant\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:927:\"INGREDIENTS: AQUA / WATER / EAU, GLYCERIN, PRUNUS AMYGDALUS DULCIS (SWEET ALMOND) SEED EXTRACT, POLYSORBATE 60, SORBITAN STEARATE, CETYL ALCOHOL, ISONONYL ISONONANOATE, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, CYCLOPENTASILOXANE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, ZEA MAYS (CORN) STARCH, ALBIZIA JULIBRISSIN BARK EXTRACT, DIMETHICONE, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, CYCLOHEXASILOXANE, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, METHYLPROPANEDIOL, TRIETHANOLAMINE, AESCULUS HIPPOCASTANUM (HORSE CHESTNUT) SEED EXTRACT, CAFFEINE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, XANTHAN GUM, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, POTASSIUM SORBATE, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, PHENETHYL ALCOHOL, MAGNESIUM GLUCONATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL PG-DIMONIUM CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE, PROPYLPARABEN, 1,2-HEXANEDIOL, CARBOMER, METHYLSILANOL MANNURONATE, SODIUM LACTATE, ETHYLPARABEN, POLYSORBATE 20, SODIUM BENZOATE, HYDROLYZED HYALURONIC ACID, CITRIC ACID, DARUTOSIDE, PALMITOYL TRIPEPTIDE-1, PALMITOYL TETRAPEPTIDE-7\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
