(9185, 32280, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:2:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:38:\"Not a hand cream but a hand treatment.\";s:7:\"content\";s:2560:\"Gisèle Delorme prizes itself in the development of extremely potent products using in the newest and high-tech ingredients. This hand treatment is a testament to its core value as it uses a whitening-lightening patented technology <strong>– X50® Pure White and Senestem™</strong>\r\n\r\n1. <strong>X50® Pure White</strong> This patented delivery system is called “Cosmetic Drone™ for whitening”. It is an innovative peptide- ased complex that brightens the skin in an intelligent way. It has three parts, an active peptide, a polymer capsule, and a “key” peptide or ligand attached outside of the capsule that binds to specific receptors on melanocytes like a key/lock ensuring direct delivery\r\n\r\nX50® Pure White acts only in the hyperpigmented and discolored areas (on overexpressed melanocytes) that allow to even out the skin tone, diminishing dark spots, and providing a radiant glow. This intelligent ingredient recognizes and targets the melanocytes with high accuracy providing maximum outcomes with maximum effectiveness, and exposing an even, youthful, and balanced skin tone.\r\n\r\nX50 Pure White is able to deliver the most even skin tone possible without any hint of the HALO effect caused by traditional skin lighteners, making it unique and putting it at the forefront of eliminating hyperpigmentation.\r\n\r\n2. The second active acting on visible signs of aging is the <strong>SENESTEM®</strong>\r\n\r\nSenestem™ is an active ingredient that renews protein synthesis to prevent cellular skin aging and extracellular matrix degradation. It is therefore used in the highest quality anti-aging products.\r\n\r\nThrough an innovative mechanism based on the inhibition of MicroRNAs (short segments of RNA), Senestem™ restarts protein synthesis and delays cellular aging and extracellular matrix degradation. Senestem™ is the first cosmetic active ingredient designed specifically for this purpose.\r\n\r\n<strong>Age spots are history:</strong> Through its calming and strengthening effect on melanocytes (the pigment-producing cells of the skin), Senestem™ reduces the overproduction of melanin. This is the pigment responsible for colouring the skin. If too much melanin is produced, this is manifested, for example, by the appearance of age spots. By using high-quality Senestem™, these cosmetically disturbing skin changes can be reduced.\r\n\r\n<strong>Firmer skin after one month:</strong> In addition to reducing hyperpigmentation, Senestem™ reduces wrinkles and increases skin firmness and elasticity after just one month of regular use.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:691:\"AQUA (WATER), GLYCERIN, CAPRYLIC/CAPRIC TRIGLYCERIDE, DICAPRYLYL, CARBONATE, JOJOBA ESTERS, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, GLYCERYL BEHENATE, GLYCERYL STEARATE CITRATE, ISOPROPYL PALMITATE, HELIANTHUS ANNUUS (SUNFLOWER) SEED WAX, SQUALANE, SODIUM HYALURONATE, PLANTAGO LANCEOLATA LEAF EXTRACT, ACACIA DECURRENS FLOWER WAX, POLYGLYCERIN-3, GLYCINE SOJA (SOYBEAN) OIL, TOCOPHEROL, BETA-SITOSTEROL, SQUALENE, PALMITOYL OLIGOPEPTIDE, SODIUM STEAROYL GLUTAMATE, PROPANEDIOL, LAUROYL, LYSINE, PARFUM (FRAGRANCE), SODIUM POLYACRYLATE, DIMETHICONE, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE, PHENYLPROPANOL, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, XANTHAN GUM, CITRIC ACID, GLYCOLIC ACID, LACTIC ACID, POLYVINYL ALCOHOL, SODIUM HYDROXIDE.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
