(9233, 32288, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:3:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Description\";s:7:\"content\";s:373:\"With its delicate floral scent and its high concentration of vegetable oils and butters, this professional hair mask is formulated to cover the spectrum of hair types. The repair hair mask is formulated to repair, nourish and revitalize even the driest hair. Ideal for treating fine and damaged hair without added heaviness.\r\n\r\nYour hair regains core, shine and suppleness.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:33:\"How to use your repair hair mask?\";s:7:\"content\";s:346:\"Step 1 <strong>The essential shampoo</strong> \r\n\r\nStep 2 <strong>The repair hair mask</strong>\r\n\r\n&gt;Apply evenly a reasonable amount on the length of your locks.\r\n\r\n&gt;Leave on for 5 to 10 minutes to sooth the scales.\r\n\r\n&gt;Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n\r\n&gt;Gently wring-out excess water from your hair.\r\n\r\n&gt;Blow dry if desired.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:414:\"<strong>Jojoba oil</strong> will energize and tone your roots\r\n\r\n<strong>The acacia gum’s</strong> toning action will help your locks gain strength and volume.\r\n\r\n<strong>Shea butter and abyssinisa crambe oil</strong> is the perfect combination to gently manage, untangle and revive your hair.\r\n\r\n<strong>Vitamin B5 and camellia oil</strong> will help dull and tired hair restore its natural glow and suppleness.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
