(9241, 32290, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:5:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Description\";s:7:\"content\";s:488:\"This shampoo will leave you hair healthier, stronger while facilitating styling. It also protects the hair and roots from UV rays and high temperature blow-drying.\r\n\r\nThanks to its formula, this professional shampoo gives your hair vibrance, volume, shine and silkiness while respectful of your scalp’s skin sensitivity. It is lightly perfumed with subtle notes of scots pine essential oil. The perfume fades away while drying, leaving your hair with a fresh, natural and clean feeling.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"How to apply your shampoo?\";s:7:\"content\";s:851:\"Gisèle Delorme recommends 3 treatments per week. This should be sufficient for your hair to feel and look perfectly clean. If you need/want to use daily, please feel free to do so too.\r\n\r\nStep1 <strong>Roots and short hair.</strong>\r\n&gt;Untangle your hair to facilitate washing and rinsing.\r\n&gt;Apply, preferably on dry scalp, this very liquid shampoo root by root with the help of the specifically designed cannula.\r\n\r\n&gt;Wet your hands as needed to help create a light foam.\r\n&gt;Massage delicately your scalp with circular motions to remove any excess sebum and pollution.\r\n&gt;Rinse. If necessary, go to step 2.\r\n \r\nStep 2  <strong>Locks, when long.</strong>\r\n&gt;After step 1, using the palm of your hands, apply shampoo to top of your hair, evenly on all sides.\r\n&gt;Stroke hair locks repeatedly from head to tip.\r\n&gt;Rinse hair abundantly.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"How to maintain healthy locks?\";s:7:\"content\";s:304:\"To promote healthy and luminous hair, it is imperative to use a shampoo respectful of your scalp’s sensitivity as well as your locks.\r\n\r\nIt is also important to protect your hair in between washes. Indeed, a professionally developed shampoo should first and foremost wash your hair without damaging it.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Key Ingredients\";s:7:\"content\";s:499:\"<strong>Vegetable surfactants</strong> allow a soft wash and protects your locks.\r\n\r\n<strong>Coconut and oat lipo-amino acids</strong> are the plant-based sourced cleansing base\r\n\r\n<strong>Castor oil associated</strong> with the beta carotene deeply nourishes, hydrates and protects your cuticles and scales. It ultimately helps revive the natural shine of your hair.\r\n\r\n<strong>The scots pine essential oil</strong> acts on the sebum which tones and freshens the roots for souple and luminous locks\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:570:\"AQUA / WATER, PEG-15 COCOPOLYAMINE, SODIUM LAUROYL OAT AMINOACIDS, COCOBETAINE, PEG-35 CASTOR OIL, DIPOTASSIUM PHOSPHATE, SODIUM COCOYL AMINO ACIDS, BENZYL ALCOHOL, BUTYLENE GLYCOL, PINUS SYLVESTRIS LEAF OIL, POTASSIUM DIMETHICONE PEG-7 PANTHENYL PHOSPHATE, SODIUM LAURETH SULFATE, SODIUM LAURETH-8 SULFATE, TRIDECETH-9, DISODIUM EDTA, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, LAURIC ACID, PEG-5 ETHYLHEXANOATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, MAGNESIUM LAURETH SULFATE, MAGNESIUM LAURETH-8 SULFATE, SODIUM OLETH SULFATE, LIMONENE, MAGNESIUM OLETH SULFATE, BETA-CAROTENE CI 15985 / YELLOW 6\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
