(9250, 32293, 'wb_custom_tabs', 'a:3:{i:0;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Description\";s:7:\"content\";s:1449:\"This hair care, with its non-greasy texture, provides suppleness, shine, good hold as well as all the essential elements for the vitality of the hair. The star ingredients of its formula are silk protein and vitamin A. The orange and petitgrain essential oils contribute to a heathier metabolic activity and helps strengthen the roots. This lotion is suitable for all hair types.\r\n\r\n<strong>Silk protein,</strong> combined with the natural keratin of our hair, helps protect it, deeply nourish it and restores strength and vitality:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Promotes hair elasticity to prevent breakage.</li>\r\n 	<li>Helps repair and prevent split ends.</li>\r\n 	<li>Helps hair retain moisture for longer periods.</li>\r\n 	<li>Improves softness and suppleness.</li>\r\n 	<li>Improves shine.</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduces dryness.</li>\r\n 	<li>Makes hair less frizzy and easier to comb.</li>\r\n 	<li>Reduces static electricity by neutralizing surface electrical charge.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<strong>Vitamin A </strong>and its antioxidant properties contribute to the suppleness and shine of the hair. Indeed, vitamin A stimulates and regulates the production of sebum which nourishes and protects the hair fiber. Sebum is the protective layer of your scalp that is too often weakened and overstimulated. This stabilizing role of vitamin A is essential to ensure optimal protection, healing and hydration of the scalp. Thus the hair fiber regains strength, shine and natural suppleness.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"How to use?\";s:7:\"content\";s:204:\"Daily care without rinsing.\r\n\r\nSpray a few pumps on wet or dry lengths. With your fingers, gently massage the scalp and the lengths to distribute the treatment. Comb , dry and style according your habits.\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:6:{s:5:\"title\";s:4:\"INCI\";s:7:\"content\";s:602:\"INGREDIENTS : AQUA / WATER / EAU, HYDROGENATED POLYDECENE, GLYCERYL STEARATE, PEG-100 STEARATE, ISOPROPYL PALMITATE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, XANTHAN GUM, CETYL ALCOHOL, POTASSIUM CETYL PHOSPHATE, PENTYLENE GLYCOL, CAPRYLYL GLYCOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, HYDROXYETHYL ACRYLATE/SODIUM ACRYLOYLDIMETHYL TAURATE COPOLYMER, POLYGLYCERYL-10 LAURATE, SQUALANE, DISODIUM EDTA, COCAMIDOPROPYL PG-DIMONIUM CHLORIDE PHOSPHATE, GLYCERIN, PARFUM / FRAGRANCE, POLYSORBATE 60, MIMOSA TENUIFLORA BARK EXTRACT, SODIUM HYDROXIDE, SORBITAN ISOSTEARATE, HEXYL CINNAMAL, HYDROXYCITRONELLAL, CITRONELLOL, GERANIOL, CITRIC ACID, SODIUM\";s:8:\"tab_type\";s:5:\"local\";s:8:\"position\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"nickname\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
