(1232, 1, '2017-12-07 12:32:11', '2017-12-07 12:32:11', '[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1507214482942{margin-bottom: 8vh !important;}\"][vc_column][basel_title style=\"bordered\" color=\"primary\" title=\"<strong>TIMELINE</strong>\" subtitle=\"XTEMOS ELEMENT\" css=\".vc_custom_1507214516957{margin-bottom: 50px !important;}\"][basel_timeline line_color=\"#27aaa3\" dots_color=\"#000000\"][basel_timeline_breakpoint title=\"STEP 1\" color_bg=\"#69abf7\"][basel_timeline_item image_secondary=\"163\" position=\"right\" title_primary=\"A malesuada scelerisque aptent pretiu.\" img_size=\"760x360\"]Placerat vestibulum suspendisse ullamcorper a non adipiscing a parturient vestibulum orci duis parturient tincidunt et ac ridiculus.[/basel_timeline_item][basel_timeline_breakpoint title=\"STEP 2\" color_bg=\"#e26c6c\"][basel_timeline_item image_secondary=\"163\" title_primary=\"Senectus maecenas velit vestibulum.\" img_size=\"760x360\"]Placerat vestibulum suspendisse ullamcorper a non adipiscing a parturient vestibulum orci duis parturient tincidunt et ac ridiculus.[/basel_timeline_item][basel_timeline_breakpoint title=\"STEP 3\" color_bg=\"#21c391\"][basel_timeline_item image_secondary=\"163\" position=\"right\" title_primary=\"Imperdiet in lacinia in a enim ullam.\" img_size=\"760x360\"]Placerat vestibulum suspendisse ullamcorper a non adipiscing a parturient vestibulum orci duis parturient tincidunt et ac ridiculus.[/basel_timeline_item][/basel_timeline][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][basel_title style=\"bordered\" color=\"primary\" title=\"<strong>TIMELINE ALTERNATIVE</strong>\" subtitle=\"XTEMOS ELEMENT\" css=\".vc_custom_1507214522342{margin-bottom: 50px !important;}\"][basel_timeline line_color=\"#694644\" dots_color=\"#a56565\"][basel_timeline_breakpoint title=\"1856\" color_bg=\"#694644\"][basel_timeline_item image_secondary=\"163\" position=\"right\" color_bg=\"#f3ede8\" content_secondary=\"<em>Fermentum potenti a parturient vestibulum condimentum condimentum.\nJanuary 26th</em>\" img_size=\"760x360\"]\n<h2>Condimentum quam fringilla</h2>\nAnte dignissim parturient a ipsum a condimentum quam ipsum at eu odio a a fringilla in vestibulum dignissim parturient pharetra nisi quam fringilla fames ridiculus dui ac. Ultrices parturient dolor tempus donec.\n<div class=\"basel-button-wrapper\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\"><a class=\"btn btn-color-default btn-style-link btn-size-default\" href=\"#\">Read More</a></div>\n[/basel_timeline_item][basel_timeline_breakpoint title=\"1935\" color_bg=\"#694644\"][basel_timeline_item image_secondary=\"163\" color_bg=\"#f3ede8\" content_secondary=\"<em>Turpis at cum nec netus viverra parturient integer a accumsan fermentum.\nMay 12th</em>\" img_size=\"760x360\"]\n<h2>Parturient magna mollis</h2>\nAnte dignissim parturient a ipsum a condimentum quam ipsum at eu odio a a fringilla in vestibulum dignissim parturient pharetra nisi quam fringilla fames ridiculus dui ac. Ultrices parturient dolor tempus donec.\n<div class=\"basel-button-wrapper\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\"><a class=\"btn btn-color-default btn-style-link btn-size-default\" href=\"#\">Read More</a></div>\n[/basel_timeline_item][basel_timeline_breakpoint title=\"1980\" color_bg=\"#694644\"][basel_timeline_item image_secondary=\"163\" position=\"right\" color_bg=\"#f3ede8\" content_secondary=\"<em>Accumsan fermentum potenti a parturient vestibulum condimentum.\nApril 16th</em>\" img_size=\"760x360\"]\n<h2>Lacinia morbi netus turpis</h2>\nAnte dignissim parturient a ipsum a condimentum quam ipsum at eu odio a a fringilla in vestibulum dignissim parturient pharetra nisi quam fringilla fames ridiculus dui ac. Ultrices parturient dolor tempus donec.\n<div class=\"basel-button-wrapper\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\"><a class=\"btn btn-color-default btn-style-link btn-size-default\" href=\"#\">Read More</a></div>\n[/basel_timeline_item][basel_timeline_breakpoint title=\"2017\" color_bg=\"#694644\"][basel_timeline_item image_secondary=\"40\" position=\"full-width\" color_bg=\"#f3ede8\" content_secondary=\"<em>Placerat vulputate magnis erat suspendisse a ridiculus parturient mag.\nNovember 9th</em>\" img_size=\"full\"]\n<h2>Donec inceptos ac mi proin</h2>\nAnte dignissim parturient a ipsum a condimentum quam ipsum at eu odio a a fringilla in vestibulum dignissim parturient pharetra nisi quam fringilla fames ard ridiculus dui ac. Ultrices parturient dolor tempus donec. Enim sit quisque ut iaculis parturient faucibus a a per accumsan cubilia nibh tempor montes a habitant mus inceptos ad quam ac.Curae sodales pretium adipiscing adipiscing. A vel habitasse et a molestie odio magnis ut accumsan non tempus orci.\n<div class=\"basel-button-wrapper\" style=\"margin-top: 15px;\"><a class=\"btn btn-color-default btn-style-link btn-size-default\" href=\"#\">Read More</a></div>\n[/basel_timeline_item][/basel_timeline][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Timeline', '', 'trash', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'timeline__trashed', '', '', '2026-01-16 10:29:30', '2026-01-16 10:29:30', '', 0, 'http://dummy.xtemos.com/basel/vers/?page_id=1232', 0, 'page', '', 0),
