(32384, 1, '2026-01-19 08:34:30', '2026-01-19 08:34:30', '<p>[vc_row][vc_column][vc_tta_tabs shape=\"square\" color=\"white\" spacing=\"\" active_section=\"\" no_fill_content_area=\"true\"][vc_tta_section title=\"PASSING ORDER\" tab_id=\"1768809658827-cd030b97-d13d\"][vc_toggle title=\"DO I NEED TO CREATE AN ACCOUNT TO PLACE AN ORDER?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" open=\"true\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768810770602{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]It is necessary to create an account to be able to place an order on the site Gisèle Delorme. This account will allow you to follow the evolution of your order.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"I FORGOT MY PASSWORD, WHAT TO DO?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768810783633{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]In the login space, we invite you to click on “forgot password”. A new password will be sent to you by email.[/vc_toggle][/vc_tta_section][vc_tta_section title=\"DELIVERY\" tab_id=\"1768810824785-10d51e23-e597\"][vc_toggle title=\"WHAT ARE THE DELIVERY AREAS?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" open=\"true\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811218834{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]GD delivers around the world. When paying, options and delivery prices are offered. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com</p>\n<p>For international shipments, you will likely be required to pay customs fees based on your place of residence. Gisèle Delorme will not cover these costs.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"WHAT ARE THE MEANS AND COSTS OF DELIVERY?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811233349{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]All our products are sent from Paris, France.</p>\n<p>Due to the constraints of the distribution network during periods of high activity, we cannot guarantee the delivery dates.</p>\n<p>Nevertheless, we assure you that we do what is necessary, where possible, to deliver your orders as quickly as possible. To have a follow-up of your package in real time, we invite you to look at the order shipping email that will contain the carrier’s tracking number.</p>\n<p><strong>Delivery method France :</strong><br />\n<em>From 80 € of purchase, free shipping.</em><br />\n<strong>Colissimo home signature,</strong> 3 to 4 working days after processing the order.</p>\n<p><strong>Delivery method Europe:</strong><br />\n<em>From 150 € of purchase, free shipping costs.</em><br />\n<strong>DHL express,</strong> 3 to 5 working days after processing the order.</p>\n<p><strong>Delivery method World:</strong><br />\n<em>From 200 € of purchase, free delivery costs.</em><br />\n<strong>DHL express,</strong> 3 to 5 working days after processing the order.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"MY COUNTRY OF DELIVERY IS NOT AVAILABLE, HOW TO DO IT?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811270771{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]You can send us an email via gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com and we will study the feasibility and cost of a delivery in your country.[/vc_toggle][/vc_tta_section][vc_tta_section title=\"MY PAYMENT\" tab_id=\"1768810839160-bb73f360-623e\"][vc_toggle title=\"WHAT ARE THE ACCEPTED PAYMENT METHODS?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" open=\"true\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811343808{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]The site accepts payments in Carte Bleue, Visa, Mastercard and American Express.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"IS THE PAYMENT SECURE?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811382264{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]The security of your payment is our top priority!</p>\n<p>We have the Stripe payment system with 3D SECURE security device, offered by Stripe.</p>\n<p>The entire transaction is encrypted to a Secure Socket Layer (SSL) bank validation server.</p>\n<p>No banking information is kept by Gisèle Delorme.<br />\n[/vc_toggle][/vc_tta_section][vc_tta_section title=\"MY ORDER\" tab_id=\"1768811392998-73b229f4-22b0\"][vc_toggle title=\"IS IT POSSIBLE TO CANCEL OR EDIT MY ORDER?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" open=\"true\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811442305{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]Due to our quick preparation time, we cannot cancel or modify your order. However, you can assert your right of withdrawal on all or part of the order by following the procedure on our return policy.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"AM I ENTITLED TO SAMPLES?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811475370{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]We offer, depending on our availability, three samples of our products.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"I HAVE SEVERAL PROMOTIONAL CODES, CAN I APPLY THEM ON THE SAME ORDER?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811502856{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]Promotional codes are not cumulative. However, nothing prevents you from placing several orders![/vc_toggle][/vc_tta_section][vc_tta_section title=\"MY RETURNS\" tab_id=\"1768811504408-bfe8b9f5-2697\"][vc_toggle title=\"THE PRODUCT DOESN\'T SUIT ME, HOW DO I RETURN IT?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" open=\"true\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811613624{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]You have 14 days after receiving the order to return your order.</p>\n<p>Returned products must not be started, and the packaging must be intact.</p>\n<p>If a returned product does not meet these conditions, we will not be able to make your refund.</p>\n<p><strong>Instructions for the return of non-compliant/damaged product or for the return following the exercise of your rights of withdrawal (for complete information, see GTC Article 6):</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1.</strong> To return the non-compliant or damaged product(s), use the available return label by clicking on the link on our return form.</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong> To proceed to the complete return of your order following the confirmation of your rights of withdrawal, return the entire order, including samples and / or promotional objects by clicking on the link of our return form.</p>\n<p>[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"IS THE RETURN OFFERED?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811644956{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]Return costs are reimbursed at the standard rate, as soon as the return complies with the procedure in force.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"IS THE RETURN OFFERED?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" custom_font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:14px|text_align:left|color:%23252525\" custom_google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:400%20regular%3A400%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768811644956{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" use_custom_heading=\"true\"]Return costs are reimbursed at the standard rate, as soon as the return complies with the procedure in force.[/vc_toggle][/vc_tta_section][/vc_tta_tabs][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\n', 'FaQs', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '778-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-01-19 08:34:30', '2026-01-19 08:34:30', '', 778, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32384', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
