"THE GISÈLE DELORME SKIN CARE METHOD - GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:28px|text_align:center|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768552871929{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Since 1977, the Gisèle Delorme method has made it possible to create a made-to-measure treatment for every skin condition, for all ages. The exceptional results it delivers on the skin are unparalleled, placing Gisèle Delorme in a class of its own in the world of professional skin care…</p>[/vc_column_text][vc_btn title=\"TO KNOW MORE\" style=\"outline-custom\" outline_custom_color=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_background=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_text=\"#FFFFFF\" shape=\"square\" align=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768552342159{padding-top: 13px !important;padding-right: 19px !important;padding-bottom: 13px !important;padding-left: 19px !important;border-radius: 2px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\" link=\"url:%23\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_single_image image=\"31931\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768554290222{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE GISÈLE DELORME FACE LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE TRAINING -THE GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:28px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768554666363{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768554704452{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]With the Gisèle Delorme Paris skincare method, you’ll move into a new dimension and become a recognized and appreciated derma-therapist. You’ll provide unparalleled skincare treatments. Your knowledge and know-how will give you a lasting competitive edge, and the reason to add value to your services.[/vc_column_text][vc_btn title=\"TO KNOW MORE\" style=\"outline-custom\