nts on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32054\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY  GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565497019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32059\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565984333{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565974891{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565961955{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565945757{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the