nts on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32054\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565497019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32059\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565984333{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565974891{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565961955{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565945757{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the natural ingredient, even at a higher cost.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565936076{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]To ensure that our actions are in line with our vision, the performance of the products we develop is validated both in instrumental (objective) and panel trials (subjective).[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" gap=\"20\" equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568721486{background-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567381156{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR VALUES\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566587702{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our value: set high standards for ourselves; excellence for our customers.\nNotre valeur, l’exigence envers nous-même ; l’excellence pour nos clients.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566576785{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566939951{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We are demanding of ourselves. We are driven by excellence in all areas of our business.\nOur satisfaction is your complete satisfaction with the results and the brand experience.\nWe choose Partners of Excellence in areas that are at the heart of our business.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566908106{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566975530{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Our products are formulated with a French know-how by formulators who are totally independent of ingredient suppliers.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Manufacturing &amp; Packaging\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567048146{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567065539{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Gisèle Delorme products are manufactured and packaged by French family-run laboratories selected for their rigorous quality control standards.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Raw materials\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567162706{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567109803{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We select raw materials for their quality and efficacy. We commit to take the best, regardless of price, to formulate the best galenic with the most powerful active ingredients.\nAnd where performance is matched, we select an ingredient of natural origin.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Performance validation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567180403{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567217744{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Formulation excellence is measured in terms of customer satisfaction.\nWe subject our new formulas to the rigorous test performed by specialized laboratories.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Training\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567253401{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567272525{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is also expressed in the relevance and high level of academic interest of our training courses for professionals.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Facial salon or studio\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567311250{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567331561{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is the hallmark of the studios where the Gisèle Delorme method is available. Practicing beauticians and derma-therapists are driven by the demand for a sincere and responsible interpersonal relationship with their customers.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568312703{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR COMMITMENTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568332830{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Deliver proven, tangible and visible treatment benefits through both lymphatic drainage and the skincare we develop.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568656624{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568877796{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"When it comes to our core business, working upstream and downstream with like-minded people and family businesses in the quest for excellence.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568645392{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568920834{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulating, manufacturing and packaging in France. Almost all our materials come from France, if not from the EU.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568632657{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568942772{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Reduce the footprint of our activities by using 100% recyclable materials, eliminating packaging that adds nothing to the integrity of the product, and reducing the weight of transported products.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568611958{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568962415{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Listening carefully to the constructive criticism of our customers and partners to help us move forward.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568619978{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Who we are', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32042-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 05:07:44', '2026-01-17 05:07:44', '', 32042, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32065', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(32066, 1, '2026-01-16 12:59:53', '2026-01-16 12:59:53', '', 'embleme-Gisele-delorme', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'embleme-gisele-delorme', '', '', '2026-01-16 12:59:53', '2026-01-16 12:59:53', '', 32042, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/embleme-Gisele-delorme.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(32067, 1, '2026-01-16 13:02:33', '2026-01-16 13:02:33', '<p>[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE ORIGIN OF THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS BRAND - THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768563983393{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32047\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]From the very start of the Gisèle Delorme Paris brand in 1977, Madame Delorme was driven by the responsibility for results imposed on a professional brand and on the beautician using her method of treatment.<br />\r\nThe concept she created need to provide remarkable results for every client, for every skin condition and in every situation.<br />\r\nAnd right from the start, she incorporated the power of serums, a product category little known at the time of the brand’s creation. A visionary, Madame Delorme understood the benefits of these products for in-depth treatment. Her serums were all complex, and some incorporated phytotherapy.<br />\r\nSince then, the Gisèle Delorme brand has become worldwide synonymous for beauty through skin health for a community of discerning women and men.</p>\r\n<p>Thanks to its complete range of serums, it embodies made-to-measure skin care.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565346292{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"A NEW IMPETUS TO REVIVE THE BRAND\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565207373{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768564976363{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]After a period of strategic wandering between the call to switch to a full online service and its professional brick and mortar past, the brand was taken over in 2020 by a small family team who made the clear choice to revive the esthetician’s expertise. To give credence to this strategic choice, the team strengthened the foundations of the Gisèle Delorme made-to-measure skin care method. This method allows for the personalization of lymphatic drainage techniques and haute-cosmétique skincare.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565002559{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The team’s focus is revamping esthetician training. Thanks to a high-level training program, they can now join the inner circle of derma-therapists. It’s a rewarding development for both beautician and customers.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565027345{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Considering the multiple factors impacting skin beauty, the derma-therapist determines a treatment protocol for each client. This is the Gisèle Delorme global approach.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565061843{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]At the heart of the treatment, the manual lymphatic drainage technique is completely revised and enhanced to leverage and target its effectiveness.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565078260{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Inspired by the teachings of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, Gisèle Delorme Facial Lymphatic Drainage uses precise manual movements on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32054\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY  GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565497019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32059\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565984333{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565974891{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565961955{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565945757{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the natural ingredient, even at a higher cost.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565936076{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]To ensure that our actions are in line with our vision, the performance of the products we develop is validated both in instrumental (objective) and panel trials (subjective).[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" gap=\"10\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567404400{background-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567381156{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR VALUES\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566587702{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our value: set high standards for ourselves; excellence for our customers.<br />\r\nNotre valeur, l’exigence envers nous-même ; l’excellence pour nos clients.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566576785{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566939951{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We are demanding of ourselves. We are driven by excellence in all areas of our business.<br />\r\nOur satisfaction is your complete satisfaction with the results and the brand experience.<br />\r\nWe choose Partners of Excellence in areas that are at the heart of our business.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566908106{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566975530{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Our products are formulated with a French know-how by formulators who are totally independent of ingredient suppliers.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Manufacturing & Packaging\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567048146{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567065539{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Gisèle Delorme products are manufactured and packaged by French family-run laboratories selected for their rigorous quality control standards.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Raw materials\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567162706{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567109803{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We select raw materials for their quality and efficacy. We commit to take the best, regardless of price, to formulate the best galenic with the most powerful active ingredients.<br />\r\n And where performance is matched, we select an ingredient of natural origin.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Performance validation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567180403{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567217744{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Formulation excellence is measured in terms of customer satisfaction.<br />\r\nWe subject our new formulas to the rigorous test performed by specialized laboratories.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Training\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567253401{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567272525{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is also expressed in the relevance and high level of academic interest of our training courses for professionals.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Facial salon or studio\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567311250{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567331561{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is the hallmark of the studios where the Gisèle Delorme method is available. Practicing beauticians and derma-therapists are driven by the demand for a sincere and responsible interpersonal relationship with their customers.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568312703{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR COMMITMENTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568332830{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Deliver proven, tangible and visible treatment benefits through both lymphatic drainage and the skincare we develop.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568350659{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"When it comes to our core business, working upstream and downstream with like-minded people and family businesses in the quest for excellence.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568467134{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulating, manufacturing and packaging in France. Almost all our materials come from France, if not from the EU.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568500997{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Reduce the footprint of our activities by using 100% recyclable materials, eliminating packaging that adds nothing to the integrity of the product, and reducing the weight of transported products.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568524183{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Listening carefully to the constructive criticism of our customers and partners to help us move forward.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568545614{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\r\n', 'Who we are', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32042-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-16 13:02:33', '2026-01-16 13:02:33', '', 32042, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32067', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(32068, 1, '2026-01-16 13:04:27', '2026-01-16 13:04:27', '<p>[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE ORIGIN OF THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS BRAND - THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768563983393{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32047\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]From the very start of the Gisèle Delorme Paris brand in 1977, Madame Delorme was driven by the responsibility for results imposed on a professional brand and on the beautician using her method of treatment.<br />\r\nThe concept she created need to provide remarkable results for every client, for every skin condition and in every situation.<br />\r\nAnd right from the start, she incorporated the power of serums, a product category little known at the time of the brand’s creation. A visionary, Madame Delorme understood the benefits of these products for in-depth treatment. Her serums were all complex, and some incorporated phytotherapy.<br />\r\nSince then, the Gisèle Delorme brand has become worldwide synonymous for beauty through skin health for a community of discerning women and men.</p>\r\n<p>Thanks to its complete range of serums, it embodies made-to-measure skin care.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565346292{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"A NEW IMPETUS TO REVIVE THE BRAND\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565207373{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768564976363{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]After a period of strategic wandering between the call to switch to a full online service and its professional brick and mortar past, the brand was taken over in 2020 by a small family team who made the clear choice to revive the esthetician’s expertise. To give credence to this strategic choice, the team strengthened the foundations of the Gisèle Delorme made-to-measure skin care method. This method allows for the personalization of lymphatic drainage techniques and haute-cosmétique skincare.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565002559{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The team’s focus is revamping esthetician training. Thanks to a high-level training program, they can now join the inner circle of derma-therapists. It’s a rewarding development for both beautician and customers.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565027345{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Considering the multiple factors impacting skin beauty, the derma-therapist determines a treatment protocol for each client. This is the Gisèle Delorme global approach.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565061843{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]At the heart of the treatment, the manual lymphatic drainage technique is completely revised and enhanced to leverage and target its effectiveness.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565078260{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Inspired by the teachings of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, Gisèle Delorme Facial Lymphatic Drainage uses precise manual movements on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32054\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY  GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565497019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32059\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565984333{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565974891{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565961955{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565945757{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the natural ingredient, even at a higher cost.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565936076{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]To ensure that our actions are in line with our vision, the performance of the products we develop is validated both in instrumental (objective) and panel trials (subjective).[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" gap=\"10\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567404400{background-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567381156{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR VALUES\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566587702{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our value: set high standards for ourselves; excellence for our customers.<br />\r\nNotre valeur, l’exigence envers nous-même ; l’excellence pour nos clients.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566576785{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566939951{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We are demanding of ourselves. We are driven by excellence in all areas of our business.<br />\r\nOur satisfaction is your complete satisfaction with the results and the brand experience.<br />\r\nWe choose Partners of Excellence in areas that are at the heart of our business.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566908106{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566975530{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Our products are formulated with a French know-how by formulators who are totally independent of ingredient suppliers.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Manufacturing & Packaging\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567048146{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567065539{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Gisèle Delorme products are manufactured and packaged by French family-run laboratories selected for their rigorous quality control standards.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Raw materials\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567162706{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567109803{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We select raw materials for their quality and efficacy. We commit to take the best, regardless of price, to formulate the best galenic with the most powerful active ingredients.<br />\r\nAnd where performance is matched, we select an ingredient of natural origin.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Performance validation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567180403{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567217744{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Formulation excellence is measured in terms of customer satisfaction.<br />\r\nWe subject our new formulas to the rigorous test performed by specialized laboratories.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Training\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567253401{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567272525{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is also expressed in the relevance and high level of academic interest of our training courses for professionals.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Facial salon or studio\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567311250{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567331561{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is the hallmark of the studios where the Gisèle Delorme method is available. Practicing beauticians and derma-therapists are driven by the demand for a sincere and responsible interpersonal relationship with their customers.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568312703{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR COMMITMENTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568332830{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Deliver proven, tangible and visible treatment benefits through both lymphatic drainage and the skincare we develop.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568656624{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"When it comes to our core business, working upstream and downstream with like-minded people and family businesses in the quest for excellence.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568645392{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulating, manufacturing and packaging in France. Almost all our materials come from France, if not from the EU.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568632657{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Reduce the footprint of our activities by using 100% recyclable materials, eliminating packaging that adds nothing to the integrity of the product, and reducing the weight of transported products.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568611958{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Listening carefully to the constructive criticism of our customers and partners to help us move forward.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568619978{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\r\n', 'Who we are', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32042-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-16 13:04:27', '2026-01-16 13:04:27', '', 32042, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32068', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(32069, 1, '2026-01-16 13:05:55', '2026-01-16 13:05:55', '<p>[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE ORIGIN OF THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS BRAND - THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768563983393{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32047\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]From the very start of the Gisèle Delorme Paris brand in 1977, Madame Delorme was driven by the responsibility for results imposed on a professional brand and on the beautician using her method of treatment.<br />\r\nThe concept she created need to provide remarkable results for every client, for every skin condition and in every situation.<br />\r\nAnd right from the start, she incorporated the power of serums, a product category little known at the time of the brand’s creation. A visionary, Madame Delorme understood the benefits of these products for in-depth treatment. Her serums were all complex, and some incorporated phytotherapy.<br />\r\nSince then, the Gisèle Delorme brand has become worldwide synonymous for beauty through skin health for a community of discerning women and men.</p>\r\n<p>Thanks to its complete range of serums, it embodies made-to-measure skin care.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565346292{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"A NEW IMPETUS TO REVIVE THE BRAND\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565207373{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768564976363{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]After a period of strategic wandering between the call to switch to a full online service and its professional brick and mortar past, the brand was taken over in 2020 by a small family team who made the clear choice to revive the esthetician’s expertise. To give credence to this strategic choice, the team strengthened the foundations of the Gisèle Delorme made-to-measure skin care method. This method allows for the personalization of lymphatic drainage techniques and haute-cosmétique skincare.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565002559{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The team’s focus is revamping esthetician training. Thanks to a high-level training program, they can now join the inner circle of derma-therapists. It’s a rewarding development for both beautician and customers.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565027345{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Considering the multiple factors impacting skin beauty, the derma-therapist determines a treatment protocol for each client. This is the Gisèle Delorme global approach.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565061843{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]At the heart of the treatment, the manual lymphatic drainage technique is completely revised and enhanced to leverage and target its effectiveness.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565078260{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Inspired by the teachings of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, Gisèle Delorme Facial Lymphatic Drainage uses precise manual movements on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32054\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY  GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565497019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32059\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565984333{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565974891{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565961955{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565945757{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the natural ingredient, even at a higher cost.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565936076{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]To ensure that our actions are in line with our vision, the performance of the products we develop is validated both in instrumental (objective) and panel trials (subjective).[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" gap=\"20\" equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568721486{background-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567381156{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR VALUES\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566587702{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our value: set high standards for ourselves; excellence for our customers.<br />\r\nNotre valeur, l’exigence envers nous-même ; l’excellence pour nos clients.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566576785{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566939951{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We are demanding of ourselves. We are driven by excellence in all areas of our business.<br />\r\nOur satisfaction is your complete satisfaction with the results and the brand experience.<br />\r\nWe choose Partners of Excellence in areas that are at the heart of our business.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566908106{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566975530{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Our products are formulated with a French know-how by formulators who are totally independent of ingredient suppliers.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Manufacturing & Packaging\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567048146{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567065539{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Gisèle Delorme products are manufactured and packaged by French family-run laboratories selected for their rigorous quality control standards.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Raw materials\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567162706{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567109803{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We select raw materials for their quality and efficacy. We commit to take the best, regardless of price, to formulate the best galenic with the most powerful active ingredients.<br />\r\nAnd where performance is matched, we select an ingredient of natural origin.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Performance validation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567180403{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567217744{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Formulation excellence is measured in terms of customer satisfaction.<br />\r\nWe subject our new formulas to the rigorous test performed by specialized laboratories.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Training\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567253401{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567272525{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is also expressed in the relevance and high level of academic interest of our training courses for professionals.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Facial salon or studio\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567311250{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567331561{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is the hallmark of the studios where the Gisèle Delorme method is available. Practicing beauticians and derma-therapists are driven by the demand for a sincere and responsible interpersonal relationship with their customers.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568312703{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR COMMITMENTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568332830{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Deliver proven, tangible and visible treatment benefits through both lymphatic drainage and the skincare we develop.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568656624{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"full\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568750061{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"When it comes to our core business, working upstream and downstream with like-minded people and family businesses in the quest for excellence.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568645392{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulating, manufacturing and packaging in France. Almost all our materials come from France, if not from the EU.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568632657{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Reduce the footprint of our activities by using 100% recyclable materials, eliminating packaging that adds nothing to the integrity of the product, and reducing the weight of transported products.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568611958{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Listening carefully to the constructive criticism of our customers and partners to help us move forward.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568619978{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\r\n', 'Who we are', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32042-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-16 13:05:55', '2026-01-16 13:05:55', '', 32042, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32069', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(32070, 1, '2026-01-16 13:06:27', '2026-01-16 13:06:27', '<p>[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE ORIGIN OF THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS BRAND - THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768563983393{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32047\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]From the very start of the Gisèle Delorme Paris brand in 1977, Madame Delorme was driven by the responsibility for results imposed on a professional brand and on the beautician using her method of treatment.<br />\r\nThe concept she created need to provide remarkable results for every client, for every skin condition and in every situation.<br />\r\nAnd right from the start, she incorporated the power of serums, a product category little known at the time of the brand’s creation. A visionary, Madame Delorme understood the benefits of these products for in-depth treatment. Her serums were all complex, and some incorporated phytotherapy.<br />\r\nSince then, the Gisèle Delorme brand has become worldwide synonymous for beauty through skin health for a community of discerning women and men.</p>\r\n<p>Thanks to its complete range of serums, it embodies made-to-measure skin care.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565346292{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"A NEW IMPETUS TO REVIVE THE BRAND\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565207373{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768564976363{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]After a period of strategic wandering between the call to switch to a full online service and its professional brick and mortar past, the brand was taken over in 2020 by a small family team who made the clear choice to revive the esthetician’s expertise. To give credence to this strategic choice, the team strengthened the foundations of the Gisèle Delorme made-to-measure skin care method. This method allows for the personalization of lymphatic drainage techniques and haute-cosmétique skincare.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565002559{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The team’s focus is revamping esthetician training. Thanks to a high-level training program, they can now join the inner circle of derma-therapists. It’s a rewarding development for both beautician and customers.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565027345{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Considering the multiple factors impacting skin beauty, the derma-therapist determines a treatment protocol for each client. This is the Gisèle Delorme global approach.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565061843{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]At the heart of the treatment, the manual lymphatic drainage technique is completely revised and enhanced to leverage and target its effectiveness.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565078260{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Inspired by the teachings of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, Gisèle Delorme Facial Lymphatic Drainage uses precise manual movements on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32054\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY  GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565497019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32059\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565984333{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565974891{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565961955{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565945757{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the natural ingredient, even at a higher cost.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565936076{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]To ensure that our actions are in line with our vision, the performance of the products we develop is validated both in instrumental (objective) and panel trials (subjective).[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" gap=\"20\" equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568721486{background-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567381156{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR VALUES\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566587702{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our value: set high standards for ourselves; excellence for our customers.<br />\r\nNotre valeur, l’exigence envers nous-même ; l’excellence pour nos clients.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566576785{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566939951{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We are demanding of ourselves. We are driven by excellence in all areas of our business.<br />\r\nOur satisfaction is your complete satisfaction with the results and the brand experience.<br />\r\nWe choose Partners of Excellence in areas that are at the heart of our business.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566908106{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566975530{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Our products are formulated with a French know-how by formulators who are totally independent of ingredient suppliers.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Manufacturing & Packaging\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567048146{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567065539{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Gisèle Delorme products are manufactured and packaged by French family-run laboratories selected for their rigorous quality control standards.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Raw materials\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567162706{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567109803{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We select raw materials for their quality and efficacy. We commit to take the best, regardless of price, to formulate the best galenic with the most powerful active ingredients.<br />\r\nAnd where performance is matched, we select an ingredient of natural origin.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Performance validation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567180403{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567217744{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Formulation excellence is measured in terms of customer satisfaction.<br />\r\nWe subject our new formulas to the rigorous test performed by specialized laboratories.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Training\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567253401{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567272525{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is also expressed in the relevance and high level of academic interest of our training courses for professionals.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Facial salon or studio\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567311250{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567331561{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is the hallmark of the studios where the Gisèle Delorme method is available. Practicing beauticians and derma-therapists are driven by the demand for a sincere and responsible interpersonal relationship with their customers.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568312703{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR COMMITMENTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568332830{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Deliver proven, tangible and visible treatment benefits through both lymphatic drainage and the skincare we develop.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568656624{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"small\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568783884{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"When it comes to our core business, working upstream and downstream with like-minded people and family businesses in the quest for excellence.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568645392{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulating, manufacturing and packaging in France. Almost all our materials come from France, if not from the EU.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568632657{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Reduce the footprint of our activities by using 100% recyclable materials, eliminating packaging that adds nothing to the integrity of the product, and reducing the weight of transported products.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568611958{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Listening carefully to the constructive criticism of our customers and partners to help us move forward.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568619978{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\r\n', 'Who we are', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32042-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-16 13:06:27', '2026-01-16 13:06:27', '', 32042, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32070', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(32071, 1, '2026-01-16 13:08:04', '2026-01-16 13:08:04', '<p>[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE ORIGIN OF THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS BRAND - THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768563983393{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32047\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]From the very start of the Gisèle Delorme Paris brand in 1977, Madame Delorme was driven by the responsibility for results imposed on a professional brand and on the beautician using her method of treatment.<br />\r\nThe concept she created need to provide remarkable results for every client, for every skin condition and in every situation.<br />\r\nAnd right from the start, she incorporated the power of serums, a product category little known at the time of the brand’s creation. A visionary, Madame Delorme understood the benefits of these products for in-depth treatment. Her serums were all complex, and some incorporated phytotherapy.<br />\r\nSince then, the Gisèle Delorme brand has become worldwide synonymous for beauty through skin health for a community of discerning women and men.</p>\r\n<p>Thanks to its complete range of serums, it embodies made-to-measure skin care.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565346292{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"A NEW IMPETUS TO REVIVE THE BRAND\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565207373{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768564976363{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]After a period of strategic wandering between the call to switch to a full online service and its professional brick and mortar past, the brand was taken over in 2020 by a small family team who made the clear choice to revive the esthetician’s expertise. To give credence to this strategic choice, the team strengthened the foundations of the Gisèle Delorme made-to-measure skin care method. This method allows for the personalization of lymphatic drainage techniques and haute-cosmétique skincare.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565002559{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The team’s focus is revamping esthetician training. Thanks to a high-level training program, they can now join the inner circle of derma-therapists. It’s a rewarding development for both beautician and customers.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565027345{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Considering the multiple factors impacting skin beauty, the derma-therapist determines a treatment protocol for each client. This is the Gisèle Delorme global approach.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565061843{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]At the heart of the treatment, the manual lymphatic drainage technique is completely revised and enhanced to leverage and target its effectiveness.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565078260{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Inspired by the teachings of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, Gisèle Delorme Facial Lymphatic Drainage uses precise manual movements on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32054\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY  GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565497019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32059\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565984333{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565974891{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565961955{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565945757{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the natural ingredient, even at a higher cost.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565936076{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]To ensure that our actions are in line with our vision, the performance of the products we develop is validated both in instrumental (objective) and panel trials (subjective).[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" gap=\"20\" equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568721486{background-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567381156{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR VALUES\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566587702{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our value: set high standards for ourselves; excellence for our customers.<br />\r\nNotre valeur, l’exigence envers nous-même ; l’excellence pour nos clients.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566576785{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566939951{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We are demanding of ourselves. We are driven by excellence in all areas of our business.<br />\r\nOur satisfaction is your complete satisfaction with the results and the brand experience.<br />\r\nWe choose Partners of Excellence in areas that are at the heart of our business.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566908106{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566975530{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Our products are formulated with a French know-how by formulators who are totally independent of ingredient suppliers.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Manufacturing & Packaging\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567048146{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567065539{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Gisèle Delorme products are manufactured and packaged by French family-run laboratories selected for their rigorous quality control standards.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Raw materials\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567162706{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567109803{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We select raw materials for their quality and efficacy. We commit to take the best, regardless of price, to formulate the best galenic with the most powerful active ingredients.<br />\r\nAnd where performance is matched, we select an ingredient of natural origin.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Performance validation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567180403{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567217744{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Formulation excellence is measured in terms of customer satisfaction.<br />\r\nWe subject our new formulas to the rigorous test performed by specialized laboratories.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Training\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567253401{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567272525{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is also expressed in the relevance and high level of academic interest of our training courses for professionals.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Facial salon or studio\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567311250{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567331561{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is the hallmark of the studios where the Gisèle Delorme method is available. Practicing beauticians and derma-therapists are driven by the demand for a sincere and responsible interpersonal relationship with their customers.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568312703{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR COMMITMENTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568332830{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Deliver proven, tangible and visible treatment benefits through both lymphatic drainage and the skincare we develop.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568656624{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568877796{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"When it comes to our core business, working upstream and downstream with like-minded people and family businesses in the quest for excellence.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568645392{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulating, manufacturing and packaging in France. Almost all our materials come from France, if not from the EU.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568632657{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Reduce the footprint of our activities by using 100% recyclable materials, eliminating packaging that adds nothing to the integrity of the product, and reducing the weight of transported products.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568611958{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Listening carefully to the constructive criticism of our customers and partners to help us move forward.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568619978{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\r\n', 'Who we are', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32042-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-16 13:08:04', '2026-01-16 13:08:04', '', 32042, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32071', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(32072, 1, '2026-01-16 13:09:25', '2026-01-16 13:09:25', '<p>[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE ORIGIN OF THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS BRAND - THE GISÈLE DELORME PARIS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768563983393{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32047\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]From the very start of the Gisèle Delorme Paris brand in 1977, Madame Delorme was driven by the responsibility for results imposed on a professional brand and on the beautician using her method of treatment.<br />\r\nThe concept she created need to provide remarkable results for every client, for every skin condition and in every situation.<br />\r\nAnd right from the start, she incorporated the power of serums, a product category little known at the time of the brand’s creation. A visionary, Madame Delorme understood the benefits of these products for in-depth treatment. Her serums were all complex, and some incorporated phytotherapy.<br />\r\nSince then, the Gisèle Delorme brand has become worldwide synonymous for beauty through skin health for a community of discerning women and men.</p>\r\n<p>Thanks to its complete range of serums, it embodies made-to-measure skin care.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565346292{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"A NEW IMPETUS TO REVIVE THE BRAND\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565207373{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768564976363{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]After a period of strategic wandering between the call to switch to a full online service and its professional brick and mortar past, the brand was taken over in 2020 by a small family team who made the clear choice to revive the esthetician’s expertise. To give credence to this strategic choice, the team strengthened the foundations of the Gisèle Delorme made-to-measure skin care method. This method allows for the personalization of lymphatic drainage techniques and haute-cosmétique skincare.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565002559{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The team’s focus is revamping esthetician training. Thanks to a high-level training program, they can now join the inner circle of derma-therapists. It’s a rewarding development for both beautician and customers.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565027345{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Considering the multiple factors impacting skin beauty, the derma-therapist determines a treatment protocol for each client. This is the Gisèle Delorme global approach.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565061843{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]At the heart of the treatment, the manual lymphatic drainage technique is completely revised and enhanced to leverage and target its effectiveness.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565078260{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Inspired by the teachings of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, Gisèle Delorme Facial Lymphatic Drainage uses precise manual movements on the upper body to restore radiance, toning and cellular regeneration of the skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32054\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME\'S VISION OF BEAUTY  GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768565497019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32059\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565984333{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565974891{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises. The results of our lymphatic drainage technique and the effectiveness of our products are visible. The loyalty of Gisèle Delorme’s derma-therapists and customers is proof that her approach to beauty endures the passing of time.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565961955{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Our vision is also to market haute-cosmétique skincare with requirements on performance, sensory quality and environmental impact.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565945757{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]However, we are not constrained by the tyranny of all-natural. Our choice of ingredients, particularly active ingredients, is motivated by performance. Yet, where performance is equivalent, we will choose the natural ingredient, even at a higher cost.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768565936076{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]To ensure that our actions are in line with our vision, the performance of the products we develop is validated both in instrumental (objective) and panel trials (subjective).[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" gap=\"20\" equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568721486{background-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567381156{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR VALUES\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566587702{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Our value: set high standards for ourselves; excellence for our customers.<br />\r\nNotre valeur, l’exigence envers nous-même ; l’excellence pour nos clients.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566576785{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566939951{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We are demanding of ourselves. We are driven by excellence in all areas of our business.<br />\r\nOur satisfaction is your complete satisfaction with the results and the brand experience.<br />\r\nWe choose Partners of Excellence in areas that are at the heart of our business.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768566908106{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768566975530{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Our products are formulated with a French know-how by formulators who are totally independent of ingredient suppliers.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Manufacturing & Packaging\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567048146{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567065539{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Gisèle Delorme products are manufactured and packaged by French family-run laboratories selected for their rigorous quality control standards.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Raw materials\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567162706{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567109803{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]We select raw materials for their quality and efficacy. We commit to take the best, regardless of price, to formulate the best galenic with the most powerful active ingredients.<br />\r\nAnd where performance is matched, we select an ingredient of natural origin.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Performance validation\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567180403{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567217744{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Formulation excellence is measured in terms of customer satisfaction.<br />\r\nWe subject our new formulas to the rigorous test performed by specialized laboratories.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Training\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567253401{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567272525{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is also expressed in the relevance and high level of academic interest of our training courses for professionals.[/vc_column_text][vc_custom_heading text=\"Facial salon or studio\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768567311250{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768567331561{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\" source=\"\" text=\"Formulation\" link=\"\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:15px|text_align:left|color:%23605F65\" use_theme_fonts=\"\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\"]Excellence is the hallmark of the studios where the Gisèle Delorme method is available. Practicing beauticians and derma-therapists are driven by the demand for a sincere and responsible interpersonal relationship with their customers.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568312703{margin-top: 45px !important;margin-bottom: 45px !important;padding-top: 35px !important;padding-right: 55px !important;padding-bottom: 35px !important;padding-left: 55px !important;background-color: #FFFFFF !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"OUR COMMITMENTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568332830{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Deliver proven, tangible and visible treatment benefits through both lymphatic drainage and the skincare we develop.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568656624{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568877796{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"When it comes to our core business, working upstream and downstream with like-minded people and family businesses in the quest for excellence.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568645392{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568920834{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Formulating, manufacturing and packaging in France. Almost all our materials come from France, if not from the EU.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568632657{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568942772{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Reduce the footprint of our activities by using 100% recyclable materials, eliminating packaging that adds nothing to the integrity of the product, and reducing the weight of transported products.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568611958{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"60*60\" alignment=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568962415{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"Listening carefully to the constructive criticism of our customers and partners to help us move forward.\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768568619978{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/6\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\r\n', 'Who we are', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32042-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-16 13:09:25', '2026-01-16 13:09:25', '', 32042, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32072', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
