(32097, 1, '2026-01-17 04:32:31', '2026-01-17 04:32:31', '[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"TO WHOM IS IT FOR ?\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768624691030{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/12\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"30*30\" alignment=\"right\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625396574{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"11/12\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625178024{padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]Skincare professionals, qualified beauticians, motivated by a differentiating specialization in skincare, and keen to continuously upgrade their skills.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/12\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"30*30\" alignment=\"right\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625415048{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"11/12\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625178024{padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]Demanding customers who aspire to tangible, visible results on the beauty and health of their skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768626053038{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768625950369{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE PROMISE\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625830874{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_single_image image=\"32106\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625578857{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]For people looking for skin care that enhances their beauty, Gisèle Delorme, through its method, technique and products, is the brand committed to this result. Whatever the skin condition and concerns your customer has, our made-to-measure skin care delivers remarkable results. This is thanks to our exclusive combination of haute-cosmétique skincare and our Gisèle Delorme original manual lymphatic drainage technique.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625600906{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]Whether it is a younger skin in need of prevention, hydration or treatment of imperfections and impurities, or a skin lacking firmness, nutrition and radiance, the Gisèle Delorme method has an answer to every skin concern.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625621577{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]At the beauty salon, your customers will benefit from your know-how and rigorous training as a derma-therapist trained by the Gisèle Delorme teams. With your expert hands, you will deliver a lymphatic drainage treatment whose detoxifying and tissue-regenerating effects are directly visible on the skin.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625644537{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]At home, your customers will benefit from your derma-therapeutic advice, summarized in their prescription. Haute-cosmétique formulas that can be combined, will enable them to continue their treatment at home, between appointments with a professional.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768626985779{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE SKIN CARE METHOD\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626129150{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32111\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626228242{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Since 1977, the Gisèle Delorme method has made it possible to create a made-to-measure treatment for every skin condition, for all ages. The exceptional results it delivers on the skin are unparalleled, placing Gisèle Delorme in a class of its own in the world of professional skin care.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626242051{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]The method draws its strength by harnessing the power of information. All the factors may impact the skin’s beauty are collected through an extensive diagnostic phase. From the outset, Madame Delorme understood the need to include, for example, the roles of diet, lifestyle, stress, hormonal cycle, climate and other factors in defining the skin care protocol.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626255873{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Considering the multitude of factors involved is what we call the “Gisèle Delorme global approach”. It’s the foundation of the relationship of trust between the expert derma-therapist and her client.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768627093730{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768627156187{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"The method is based on 4 areas of expertise mastered by the derma-therapist:\" font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626439538{margin-bottom: 35px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner content_placement=\"middle\"][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"1 – Perfect knowledge of the body’s physiology.\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:16px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626789179{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"2 – The ability to carry out an in-depth “global” diagnosis, analysing and synthesizing the results to develop a customized protocol (personalized products and drainage).\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:16px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626769902{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32113\" img_size=\"full\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"3 – Mastering the Gisèle Delorme lymphatic drainage.\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:16px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626807004{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"4 – The relationship of trust.\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:16px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626834514{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768627622470{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE PRODUCTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768627345579{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32121\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"2/3\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627753089{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The products of the Gisèle Delorme range are designed to deliver a made-to-measure treatment. You have at your disposal a “toolbox” with which to compose a personalized treatment at every phase.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627765217{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]In a beauty salon, for example, depending on the diagnosis, you can take advantage of the differentiating properties of a same product yet applied differently, of product combinations within the same family, and of a combination of active ingredients from serums to be integrated into almost every phase of the treatment.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627775316{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]For example, depending on the diagnosis, in the cleansing phase, the exfoliating cream can be used in 3 different ways:[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627787557{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]1. For normal to oily skin, you can enjoy the cleansing power of manual exfoliation performed until full flacking is achieved.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627799648{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]2. On the other hand, for dull, mature skin with pigmentation spots, this same exfoliating cream should be used in combination with Essential Glow renovating Serum to benefit from a dual exfoliation. Mechanical from the cream and chemical, thanks to AHA in the serum.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627812442{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]3. For sensitive to dehydrated skin, the scrub should be used as a cleanser. The combination of water and scrub will provide a gentler mechanical action.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627825212{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]In the subsequent phases of the treatment, customized combinations are further enhanced\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Combinations of serums to provide in-depth coverage of the various needs required for customized care.</li>\r\n 	<li>Combination of several masks while adding the benefits of serums.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627838019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Gisèle Delorme’s product formulas are complex, for several reasons.\r\nFirst, to meet the result expectations of a demanding clients. And results mean formulas with multiple active ingredients.\r\nThe second is the specificity of our galenic formulations. We want to achieve the best possible bioavailability our active ingredients can achieve, which implies the use of sophisticated galenic formulations such as emulsions.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627855223{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Finally, two important comments. For the same level of performance, we will select a natural ingredient, even if more expensive. Whenever possible, we use the olfactory note of one of the ingredients to add a fleeting touch of fragrance. There’s no need to overload haute-cosmétique formulas with a fragrance (which is a formula in itself). This approach allows those who so wish to wear their fragrance without it being altered by scent of their skincare.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Why choose us', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'why-choose-us', '', '', '2026-01-17 05:31:04', '2026-01-17 05:31:04', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?page_id=32097', 0, 'page', '', 0),
