padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE PROMISE\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625515922{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_single_image image=\"32106\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625578857{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]For people looking for skin care that enhances their beauty, Gisèle Delorme, through its method, technique and products, is the brand committed to this result. Whatever the skin condition and concerns your customer has, our made-to-measure skin care delivers remarkable results. This is thanks to our exclusive combination of haute-cosmétique skincare and our Gisèle Delorme original manual lymphatic drainage technique.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625600906{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]Whether it is a younger skin in need of prevention, hydration or treatment of imperfections and impurities, or a skin lacking firmness, nutrition and radiance, the Gisèle Delorme method has an answer to every skin concern.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625621577{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]At the beauty salon, your customers will benefit from your know-how and rigorous training as a derma-therapist trained by the Gisèle Delorme teams. With your expert hands, you will deliver a lymphatic drainage treatment whose detoxifying and tissue-regenerating effects are directly visible on the skin.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625644537{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]At home, your customers will benefit from your derma-therapeutic advice, summarized in their prescription. Haute-cosmétique formulas that can be combined, will enable them to continue their treatment at home, between appointments with a professional.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Why choose us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32097-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 04:56:38', '2026-01-17 04:56:38', '', 32097, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32107', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
