(32112, 1, '2026-01-17 05:04:31', '2026-01-17 05:04:31', '[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"TO WHOM IS IT FOR ?\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768624691030{margin-bottom: 40px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/12\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"30*30\" alignment=\"right\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625396574{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"11/12\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625178024{padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]Skincare professionals, qualified beauticians, motivated by a differentiating specialization in skincare, and keen to continuously upgrade their skills.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/12\"][vc_single_image image=\"32066\" img_size=\"30*30\" alignment=\"right\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625415048{margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"11/12\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625178024{padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]Demanding customers who aspire to tangible, visible results on the beauty and health of their skin.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768626053038{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768625950369{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE PROMISE\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768625830874{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_single_image image=\"32106\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625578857{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]For people looking for skin care that enhances their beauty, Gisèle Delorme, through its method, technique and products, is the brand committed to this result. Whatever the skin condition and concerns your customer has, our made-to-measure skin care delivers remarkable results. This is thanks to our exclusive combination of haute-cosmétique skincare and our Gisèle Delorme original manual lymphatic drainage technique.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625600906{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]Whether it is a younger skin in need of prevention, hydration or treatment of imperfections and impurities, or a skin lacking firmness, nutrition and radiance, the Gisèle Delorme method has an answer to every skin concern.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625621577{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]At the beauty salon, your customers will benefit from your know-how and rigorous training as a derma-therapist trained by the Gisèle Delorme teams. With your expert hands, you will deliver a lymphatic drainage treatment whose detoxifying and tissue-regenerating effects are directly visible on the skin.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768625644537{margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]At home, your customers will benefit from your derma-therapeutic advice, summarized in their prescription. Haute-cosmétique formulas that can be combined, will enable them to continue their treatment at home, between appointments with a professional.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768565870910{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE SKIN CARE METHOD\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626129150{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32111\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626228242{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Since 1977, the Gisèle Delorme method has made it possible to create a made-to-measure treatment for every skin condition, for all ages. The exceptional results it delivers on the skin are unparalleled, placing Gisèle Delorme in a class of its own in the world of professional skin care.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626242051{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]The method draws its strength by harnessing the power of information. All the factors may impact the skin’s beauty are collected through an extensive diagnostic phase. From the outset, Madame Delorme understood the need to include, for example, the roles of diet, lifestyle, stress, hormonal cycle, climate and other factors in defining the skin care protocol.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626255873{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Considering the multitude of factors involved is what we call the “Gisèle Delorme global approach”. It’s the foundation of the relationship of trust between the expert derma-therapist and her client.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Why choose us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32097-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 05:04:31', '2026-01-17 05:04:31', '', 32097, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32112', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
