eatment at home, between appointments with a professional.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768626985779{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768565407826{padding-top: 55px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE SKIN CARE METHOD\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626129150{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32111\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626228242{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Since 1977, the Gisèle Delorme method has made it possible to create a made-to-measure treatment for every skin condition, for all ages. The exceptional results it delivers on the skin are unparalleled, placing Gisèle Delorme in a class of its own in the world of professional skin care.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626242051{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]The method draws its strength by harnessing the power of information. All the factors may impact the skin’s beauty are collected through an extensive diagnostic phase. From the outset, Madame Delorme understood the need to include, for example, the roles of diet, lifestyle, stress, hormonal cycle, climate and other factors in defining the skin care protocol.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768626255873{margin-bottom: 15px !important;}\"]Considering the multitude of factors involved is what we call the “Gisèle Delorme global approach”. It’s the foundation of the relationship of trust between the expert derma-therapist and her client.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768627093730{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768627156187{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"The method is based on 4 areas of expertise mastered by the derma-therapist:\" font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626439538{margin-bottom: 35px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"1 – Perfect knowledge of the body’s physiology.\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:16px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626789179{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"2 – The ability to carry out an in-depth “global” diagnosis, analysing and synthesizing the results to develop a customized protocol (personalized products and drainage).\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:16px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626769902{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_single_image image=\"32113\" img_size=\"full\" alignment=\"center\" css=\"\"][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"3 – Mastering the Gisèle Delorme lymphatic drainage.\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:16px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626807004{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"4 – The relationship of trust.\" font_container=\"tag:h5|font_size:16px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768626834514{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Why choose us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32097-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 05:19:23', '2026-01-17 05:19:23', '', 32097, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32118', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
