chemical, thanks to AHA in the serum.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627812442{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]3. For sensitive to dehydrated skin, the scrub should be used as a cleanser. The combination of water and scrub will provide a gentler mechanical action.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627825212{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]In the subsequent phases of the treatment, customized combinations are further enhanced\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Combinations of serums to provide in-depth coverage of the various needs required for customized care.</li>\r\n 	<li>Combination of several masks while adding the benefits of serums.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627838019{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Gisèle Delorme’s product formulas are complex, for several reasons.\r\nFirst, to meet the result expectations of a demanding clients. And results mean formulas with multiple active ingredients.\r\nThe second is the specificity of our galenic formulations. We want to achieve the best possible bioavailability our active ingredients can achieve, which implies the use of sophisticated galenic formulations such as emulsions.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768627855223{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Finally, two important comments. For the same level of performance, we will select a natural ingredient, even if more expensive. Whenever possible, we use the olfactory note of one of the ingredients to add a fleeting touch of fragrance. There’s no need to overload haute-cosmétique formulas with a fragrance (which is a formula in itself). This approach allows those who so wish to wear their fragrance without it being altered by scent of their skincare.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Why choose us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32097-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 05:31:04', '2026-01-17 05:31:04', '', 32097, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32123', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
