(32160, 1, '2026-01-17 06:47:29', '2026-01-17 06:47:29', '[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]With the Gisèle Delorme Paris skincare method, you’ll move into a new dimension and become a recognized and appreciated derma-therapist. You’ll provide unparalleled skincare treatments. Your knowledge and know-how will give you a lasting competitive edge, and the reason to add value to your services. At the heart of this method is the unrivalled Gisèle Delorme facial lymphatic drainage technique, originated from the works of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, and a range of top-quality skincare products.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631612283{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631687925{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32154\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631697152{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631711640{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32155\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631705779{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631578033{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32156\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631720952{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768631452982{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"2/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"STRATEGY TO REACH LEVEL 1\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631273504{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]1. With the skin diagnostic, learn how to design a tailor-made treatment to provide a targeted response to your customers’ needs.\r\n2. In-depth revision of your knowledge of the body’s physiology as it relates to the lymphatic system.\r\n3. Understand the benefits of the lymphatic drainage.\r\n4. Acquire the first level of facial drainage technique to practice on your own.\r\n5. Build a loyal customer base thanks to the uniqueness of the Gisèle Delorme mehtod and up- sell treatments and skincare.\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"PROFESSIONALS CONCERNED\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631384332{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]Qualified beauticians, motivated by a differentiating skin care know-how, and keen to continually enhance their skills.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768627622470{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"TRAINING DURATION\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631840836{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768631908413{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Face Level 1 training takes place over <b>9 days</b> with 3 sessions of 3 days each, for a total of <b>63 hours</b>. It is a face-to-face training over a period of 3 to 6 months.[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"SESSION 1 (days 1-2-3) Creating a customized treatment and learning the fundamentals of facial lymphatic drainage.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631995728{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632106235{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Synopsis :[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632220193{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>1. To understand why the Gisèle Delorme brand is unique in the world of professional cosmetics.</li>\r\n 	<li>2. To understand every active ingredient, present in each formula to establish product combinations, the key to made-to-measure skin care.</li>\r\n 	<li>3. Learn more about the fundamentals of skin care, so you can make a diagnosis in all circumstances.</li>\r\n 	<li>4. Learn the principles of lymphatic drainage: theory and first steps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"SESSION 2 (days 4-5-6) Learning the lymphatic drainage.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768632041193{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632106235{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Synopsis :[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632295425{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>1. Deconstruct/rebuild. First, you will deconstruct your current facial care practices and rebuild it by integrating the lymphatic drainage technique into your practice.</li>\r\n 	<li>2. In a second phase, step by step, you will acquire the motions required. Gradually, you’ll feel an interaction with the body and the skin. This will indicate that you are in the active drainage phase. This is a surface practice. It’s a gentle stretching of the skin, not the muscle. A real “lace work”. The Gisèle Delorme lymphatic drainage technique demands precision, timing and dexterity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"SESSION 3 (days 7-8-9) Lymphatic drainage in stimulated real-life conditions.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768632062993{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632106235{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Synopsis :[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632339738{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>1. Review of Sessions 1 and 2: validate and consolidate skills, particularly gestures.</li>\r\n 	<li>2. Provide 1st feedback on your first try-out treatment experiences – corrections – answers to questions.</li>\r\n 	<li>3. Carry out a full treatment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][vc_btn title=\"TO FIND OUT MORE, CONTACT US DIRECTLY\" style=\"outline-custom\" outline_custom_color=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_background=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_text=\"#FFFFFF\" shape=\"square\" align=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768632433620{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;padding-top: 13px !important;padding-right: 19px !important;padding-bottom: 13px !important;padding-left: 19px !important;border-radius: 2px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\" link=\"url:%23\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Face training level 1', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32145-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 06:47:29', '2026-01-17 06:47:29', '', 32145, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32160', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(32161, 1, '2026-01-17 06:49:11', '2026-01-17 06:49:11', '<p>[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768564223228{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]With the Gisèle Delorme Paris skincare method, you’ll move into a new dimension and become a recognized and appreciated derma-therapist. You’ll provide unparalleled skincare treatments. Your knowledge and know-how will give you a lasting competitive edge, and the reason to add value to your services. At the heart of this method is the unrivalled Gisèle Delorme facial lymphatic drainage technique, originated from the works of Dr. and Mrs Vodder, and a range of top-quality skincare products.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row equal_height=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631612283{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631687925{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32154\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631697152{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631711640{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32155\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631705779{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631578033{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_single_image image=\"32156\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631720952{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768631452982{border-bottom-width: 1px !important;border-bottom-style: solid !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"2/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"STRATEGY TO REACH LEVEL 1\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631273504{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]1. With the skin diagnostic, learn how to design a tailor-made treatment to provide a targeted response to your customers’ needs.<br />\r\n2. In-depth revision of your knowledge of the body’s physiology as it relates to the lymphatic system.<br />\r\n3. Understand the benefits of the lymphatic drainage.<br />\r\n4. Acquire the first level of facial drainage technique to practice on your own.<br />\r\n5. Build a loyal customer base thanks to the uniqueness of the Gisèle Delorme mehtod and up- sell treatments and skincare.<br />\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"PROFESSIONALS CONCERNED\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631384332{margin-bottom: 30px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\"\"]Qualified beauticians, motivated by a differentiating skin care know-how, and keen to continually enhance their skills.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768627622470{border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\"][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768564624584{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"TRAINING DURATION\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:22px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631840836{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768631908413{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Face Level 1 training takes place over <b>9 days</b> with 3 sessions of 3 days each, for a total of <b>63 hours</b>. It is a face-to-face training over a period of 3 to 6 months.[/vc_column_text][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"SESSION 1 (days 1-2-3) Creating a customized treatment and learning the fundamentals of facial lymphatic drainage.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768631995728{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632106235{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Synopsis :[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632220193{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1. To understand why the Gisèle Delorme brand is unique in the world of professional cosmetics.</li>\r\n<li>2. To understand every active ingredient, present in each formula to establish product combinations, the key to made-to-measure skin care.</li>\r\n<li>3. Learn more about the fundamentals of skin care, so you can make a diagnosis in all circumstances.</li>\r\n<li>4. Learn the principles of lymphatic drainage: theory and first steps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"SESSION 2 (days 4-5-6) Learning the lymphatic drainage.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768632041193{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632106235{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Synopsis :[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632295425{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1. Deconstruct/rebuild. First, you will deconstruct your current facial care practices and rebuild it by integrating the lymphatic drainage technique into your practice.</li>\r\n<li>2. In a second phase, step by step, you will acquire the motions required. Gradually, you’ll feel an interaction with the body and the skin. This will indicate that you are in the active drainage phase. This is a surface practice. It’s a gentle stretching of the skin, not the muscle. A real “lace work”. The Gisèle Delorme lymphatic drainage technique demands precision, timing and dexterity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/3\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"SESSION 3 (days 7-8-9) Lymphatic drainage in stimulated real-life conditions.\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:18px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768632062993{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632106235{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Synopsis :[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768632339738{margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1. Review of Sessions 1 and 2: validate and consolidate skills, particularly gestures.</li>\r\n<li>2. Provide 1st feedback on your first try-out treatment experiences – corrections – answers to questions.</li>\r\n<li>3. Carry out a full treatment.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column css=\".vc_custom_1768632539108{padding-top: 0px !important;}\"][vc_btn title=\"TO FIND OUT MORE, CONTACT US DIRECTLY\" style=\"outline-custom\" outline_custom_color=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_background=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_text=\"#FFFFFF\" shape=\"square\" align=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768632548228{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;padding-top: 13px !important;padding-right: 19px !important;padding-bottom: 13px !important;padding-left: 19px !important;border-radius: 2px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\" link=\"url:%23\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\r\n', 'Face training level 1', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32145-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 06:49:11', '2026-01-17 06:49:11', '', 32145, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32161', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
