(32182, 1, '2026-01-17 08:05:21', '2026-01-17 08:05:21', '<p>[vc_section css=\".vc_custom_1768551477962{margin-top: -40px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content_no_spaces\" css=\".vc_custom_1768558439666{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_single_image image=\"31923\" img_size=\"full\" css=\"\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768551670164{margin-top: 40px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"GISÈLE DELORME’S VISION OF BEAUTY- GISÈLE DELORME’S\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:28px|text_align:center|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768552419551{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Madame Delorme reminded us that “to be beautiful, a woman must feel good about herself”. This approach shapes our vision of beauty. Our vision is based on realistic, achievable promises…</p>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_btn title=\"TO KNOW MORE\" style=\"outline-custom\" outline_custom_color=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_background=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_text=\"#FFFFFF\" shape=\"square\" align=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768552342159{padding-top: 13px !important;padding-right: 19px !important;padding-bottom: 13px !important;padding-left: 19px !important;border-radius: 2px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\" link=\"url:%23\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content_no_spaces\"][vc_column][vc_single_image image=\"31929\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768552613791{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768551670164{margin-top: 40px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE GISÈLE DELORME SKIN CARE METHOD - GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:28px|text_align:center|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768552871929{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Since 1977, the Gisèle Delorme method has made it possible to create a made-to-measure treatment for every skin condition, for all ages. The exceptional results it delivers on the skin are unparalleled, placing Gisèle Delorme in a class of its own in the world of professional skin care…</p>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_btn title=\"TO KNOW MORE\" style=\"outline-custom\" outline_custom_color=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_background=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_text=\"#FFFFFF\" shape=\"square\" align=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768552342159{padding-top: 13px !important;padding-right: 19px !important;padding-bottom: 13px !important;padding-left: 19px !important;border-radius: 2px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\" link=\"url:%23\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_single_image image=\"31931\" img_size=\"full\" css=\".vc_custom_1768554290222{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"THE GISÈLE DELORME FACE LYMPHATIC DRAINAGE TRAINING -THE GISÈLE DELORME\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:28px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768554666363{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768554704452{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]With the Gisèle Delorme Paris skincare method, you’ll move into a new dimension and become a recognized and appreciated derma-therapist. You’ll provide unparalleled skincare treatments. Your knowledge and know-how will give you a lasting competitive edge, and the reason to add value to your services.[/vc_column_text][vc_btn title=\"TO KNOW MORE\" style=\"outline-custom\" outline_custom_color=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_background=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_text=\"#FFFFFF\" shape=\"square\" css=\".vc_custom_1768554622840{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;padding-top: 13px !important;padding-right: 19px !important;padding-bottom: 13px !important;padding-left: 19px !important;border-radius: 2px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\" link=\"url:%23\"][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/2\"][vc_btn title=\"SHOP OUR PRODUCTS\" style=\"outline-custom\" outline_custom_color=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_background=\"#2B204A\" outline_custom_hover_text=\"#FFFFFF\" shape=\"square\" align=\"center\" css=\".vc_custom_1768554867504{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;padding-top: 13px !important;padding-right: 19px !important;padding-bottom: 13px !important;padding-left: 19px !important;border-radius: 2px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\" link=\"url:%23\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768555311995{margin-top: 50px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"INSTAGRAM\" font_container=\"tag:h2|font_size:36px|text_align:center|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768555289230{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_separator color=\"custom\" border_width=\"2\" el_width=\"10\" css=\".vc_custom_1768557443010{margin-top: 10px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-right: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;border-radius: 2px !important;border-color: #2B204A !important;}\" accent_color=\"#2B204A\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"#giseledelormeparis\" font_container=\"tag:p|font_size:20px|text_align:center|color:%23000000\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1768557583077{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;padding-top: 20px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}\" link=\"url:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fgiseledelormeparis%2F%3Fhl%3Dfr|target:_blank\" el_class=\"heading-hover\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"FOLLOW-US\" font_container=\"tag:h4|font_size:15px|text_align:center|color:%23999999\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\".vc_custom_1768556712634{margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\n', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '685-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 08:05:21', '2026-01-17 08:05:21', '', 685, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32182', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(32303, 1, '2026-01-17 13:14:48', '2026-01-17 13:14:48', '[vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768551670164{margin-top: 40px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768655815200{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The website www.gisele-delorme.com is edited and operated by the company G.D.I, a simplified joint-stock company with a capital of 30 000 € registered with the RCS of Paris under the number 883 094 591 000 12, and domiciled at 88 bis, rue Michel Ange 75016 PARIS.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768655835665{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]Intra-Community VAT Number : FR94883094591[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768655851184{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]The collection by G.D.I. of personal information when creating a customer account was declared to the CNIL under the number DPO-84171.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768655867678{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 20px !important;}\"]To reach G.D.I., you can write to gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com or directly on the Site via the CONTACT“CONTACT” section by stating your contact details and the reason for your request.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"ACCOMMODATION OF THE SITE\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768655940420{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The site is hosted in France by the company OVH – 2, rue Kellermann – 59100 Roubaix – France.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"DESCRIPTION OF SERVICES PROVIDED\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656030417{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The purpose of the website www.gisele-delorme.com is to inform about the products and to allow online purchase. The owner of the site strives to provide the information as accurate as possible.\r\n\r\nHowever, it cannot be held responsible for omissions, inaccuracies and deficiencies in the update, whether by it or by the third party partners who provide this information.\r\n\r\nAll the information offered on the site is given as an indication, is not exhaustive and is likely to evolve. They are given subject to changes that have been made since they were posted online.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY AND COUNTERFEITS\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656073110{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The owner of the site owns the intellectual property rights or holds the rights of use on all the elements accessible on the site, including text, images, graphics, logo, icons, sounds, software.\r\nAny reproduction, representation, modification, publication, total or partial adaptation of the elements of the site, whatever the means or the process used, is prohibited, unless written authorization prior to the email: gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com .\r\nAny unauthorized use of the site or any of its elements will be considered to constitute an infringement and prosecuted in accordance with the provisions of articles L.335-2 and following of the Intellectual Property Code.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"HYPERLINKS\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656103580{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The site gisele-delorme.com points to many other websites. G.D.I. cannot be held responsible for the content and privacy policy of these sites. G.D.I. cannot be held responsible for any direct or indirect damages that would result from their use: in particular from access to these sites and the sites linked to these sites, and for damages, non-limiting, financial or commercial damage, loss of exploitation, loss of data, even if we have been able to be notified in advance.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"DATA PROCESSING\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656131168{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The site is declared to the CNIL (https://www.cnil.fr/) under number DPO-84171.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656146306{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]G.D.I. collects your data in order to process your contact request or purchase. The required data is required for the follow-up of your request. In accordance with the Data Protection Act, you have the right to access, rectify and delete your data. You may also object, for a legitimate reason, to the use of your data. Only you can exercise these rights on your own data by contacting: G.D.I., Correspondent Informatique et libertés, 88 bis, rue Michel Ange, 75016 Paris or gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com , specifying in the subject of the letter “Right of persons” and attaching the copy of your proof of identity.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"COMMITMENTS GDPR\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656194053{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]G.D.I. undertakes to respect the confidentiality of data concerning Buyers. This privacy policy describes the personal data that is collected when you place an order with G.D.I. It also explains how your personal data is used, shared and protected, the choices you have in relation to your personal data and how to contact us.\r\n\r\nWe ask you for certain personal data to provide you with the products or services you request, when you place an order on the Site.\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656247577{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]These personal data include your:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Contact information such as email, phone number and shipping and delivery address.</li>\r\n 	<li>Your purchase and payment history.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656377932{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]G.D.I shares your personal data with:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The entities of G.D.I. for the purposes and under the conditions specified above.</li>\r\n 	<li>Third-party service providers processing personal data on behalf of G.D.I. for example for payments and credit cards, shipments and deliveries, hosting, administration and management of your data, distribution – with your agreement – of e-mails.</li>\r\n 	<li>Other third parties to the extent necessary to:</li>\r\n 	<li>Comply with an administrative request, a court decision or applicable law.\r\nDefend yourself against third-party claims.</li>\r\n 	<li>Provide assistance in the prevention of fraud or investigation (e.g. counterfeiting).</li>\r\n 	<li>Any other third party in cases where you have expressed your consent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656421836{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]When we use the services of third-party providers, we enter into contracts that require them to implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data.\r\n\r\nFor credit card payments, the data is not kept.\r\n\r\nWe may also transfer your personal data in the event that we assign or transfer all or part of our business or assets (including in the case of a reorganization, assignment, dissolution or liquidation)[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"NEWSLETTER\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656471121{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]If you consent, your data is subject to automated processing to promote our actions by e-mail. They are kept for a maximum of five years from the last contact from you or your unsubscription. In accordance with the amended Data Protection Act of 6 January 1978, you have the right to access, rectify, delete and portable your data that you can exercise by contacting gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"CUSTOMER ACCOUNT\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656511255{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]We collect this information in order to process your orders. They are kept for one year and are not reused for other purposes, nor communicated to third parties. To exercise your right of access, modification, deletion and portability of data concerning you, you can write to gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"YOUR RIGHTS\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656545104{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]You have the right to request: access to your personal data, rectification of your personal data, or the erasure or limitation of your personal data in certain circumstances provided for by applicable law. These rights are not absolute. Your consent to the processing of your personal data when you visit the Site, may be revoked by you at any time.\r\n\r\nIf you wish to request a copy of your personal data or exercise any of your rights, please contact us at gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com\r\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Legal Notice', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'legal-notice', '', '', '2026-01-17 13:38:31', '2026-01-17 13:38:31', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?page_id=32303', 0, 'page', '', 0),
