_custom_heading text=\"DESCRIPTION OF SERVICES PROVIDED\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656030417{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The purpose of the website www.gisele-delorme.com is to inform about the products and to allow online purchase. The owner of the site strives to provide the information as accurate as possible.</p>\n<p>However, it cannot be held responsible for omissions, inaccuracies and deficiencies in the update, whether by it or by the third party partners who provide this information.</p>\n<p>All the information offered on the site is given as an indication, is not exhaustive and is likely to evolve. They are given subject to changes that have been made since they were posted online.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY AND COUNTERFEITS\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656073110{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The owner of the site owns the intellectual property rights or holds the rights of use on all the elements accessible on the site, including text, images, graphics, logo, icons, sounds, software.<br />\nAny reproduction, representation, modification, publication, total or partial adaptation of the elements of the site, whatever the means or the process used, is prohibited, unless written authorization prior to the email: gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com .<br />\nAny unauthorized use of the site or any of its elements will be considered to constitute an infringement and prosecuted in accordance with the provisions of articles L.335-2 and following of the Intellectual Property Code.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"HYPERLINKS\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656103580{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The site gisele-delorme.com points to many other websites. G.D.I. cannot be held responsible for the content and privacy policy of these sites. G.D.I. cannot be held responsible for any direct or indirect damages that would result from their use: in particular from access to these sites and the sites linked to these sites, and for damages, non-limiting, financial or commercial damage, loss of exploitation, loss of data, even if we have been able to be notified in advance.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"DATA PROCESSING\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656131168{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]The site is declared to the CNIL (https://www.cnil.fr/) under number DPO-84171.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656146306{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]G.D.I. collects your data in order to process your contact request or purchase. The required data is required for the follow-up of your request. In accordance with the Data Protection Act, you have the right to access, rectify and delete your data. You may also object, for a legitimate reason, to the use of your data. Only you can exercise these rights on your own data by contacting: G.D.I., Correspondent Informatique et libertés, 88 bis, rue Michel Ange, 75016 Paris or gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com , specifying in the subject of the letter “Right of persons” and attaching the copy of your proof of identity.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"COMMITMENTS GDPR\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656194053{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]G.D.I. undertakes to respect the confidentiality of data concerning Buyers. This privacy policy describes the personal data that is collected when you place an order with G.D.I. It also explains how your personal data is used, shared and protected, the choices you have in relation to your personal data and how to contact us.</p>\n<p>We ask you for certain personal data to provide you with the products or services you request, when you place an order on the Site.<br />\n[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656247577{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]These personal data include your:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Contact information such as email, phone number and shipping and delivery address.</li>\n<li>Your purchase and payment history.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656377932{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]G.D.I shares your personal data with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The entities of G.D.I. for the purposes and under the conditions specified above.</li>\n<li>Third-party service providers processing personal data on behalf of G.D.I. for example for payments and credit cards, shipments and deliveries, hosting, administration and management of your data, distribution – with your agreement – of e-mails.</li>\n<li>Other third parties to the extent necessary to:</li>\n<li>Comply with an administrative request, a court decision or applicable law.<br />\nDefend yourself against third-party claims.</li>\n<li>Provide assistance in the prevention of fraud or investigation (e.g. counterfeiting).</li>\n<li>Any other third party in cases where you have expressed your consent.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656421836{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]When we use the services of third-party providers, we enter into contracts that require them to implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data.</p>\n<p>For credit card payments, the data is not kept.</p>\n<p>We may also transfer your personal data in the event that we assign or transfer all or part of our business or assets (including in the case of a reorganization, assignment, dissolution or liquidation)[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"COMMITMENTS GDPR\" font_container=\"tag:h3|font_size:24px|text_align:left|color:%232B204A\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Montserrat%3Aregular%2C700|font_style:700%20bold%20regular%3A700%3Anormal\" css=\"\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"NEWSLETTER\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:28px|text_align:center|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656471121{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]If you consent, your data is subject to automated processing to promote our actions by e-mail. They are kept for a maximum of five years from the last contact from you or your unsubscription. In accordance with the amended Data Protection Act of 6 January 1978, you have the right to access, rectify, delete and portable your data that you can exercise by contacting gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"CUSTOMER ACCOUNT\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:28px|text_align:center|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656511255{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]We collect this information in order to process your orders. They are kept for one year and are not reused for other purposes, nor communicated to third parties. To exercise your right of access, modification, deletion and portability of data concerning you, you can write to gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1768655986160{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"YOUR RIGHTS\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:28px|text_align:center|color:%232B204A\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\"\"][vc_column_text css=\".vc_custom_1768656545104{margin-top: 20px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;}\"]You have the right to request: access to your personal data, rectification of your personal data, or the erasure or limitation of your personal data in certain circumstances provided for by applicable law. These rights are not absolute. Your consent to the processing of your personal data when you visit the Site, may be revoked by you at any time.</p>\n<p>If you wish to request a copy of your personal data or exercise any of your rights, please contact us at gisele.online@gisele-delorme.com<br />\n[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]</p>\n', 'Legal Notice', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32303-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-01-17 13:37:25', '2026-01-17 13:37:25', '', 32303, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32305', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(32210, 1, '2026-01-17 09:29:08', '2026-01-17 09:29:08', '', 'make up remover water -125ml', 'Very mild makeup remover lotion specially formulated for eyes and lips, even for the most sensitive ones. Rich in cornflower water and marine trace elements, it respects the fragile nature of the eye contour and lips areas, while also moisturizing* them. Ideal to eliminate all trace of makeup, even waterproof, it provides to the skin comfort, softness and freshness without leaving any greasy film.\r\n\r\n*upper layers of the epidermis.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'make-up-remover-water-125ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 02:43:49', '2026-01-19 02:43:49', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32210', 0, 'product', '', 0),
