(32216, 1, '2026-01-17 11:35:12', '2026-01-17 11:35:12', '', 'velvet cleansing milk – 200ml', 'Enriched with mimosa tenuiflora bark extract (a Mexican shrub with regenerating and protecting properties), this cleansing milk is suitable to all skin types. It eliminates thoroughly and rapidly all traces of make-up and impurities and makes the skin feel fresh and soft.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'velvet-cleansing-milk-200ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 02:54:05', '2026-01-19 02:54:05', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32216', 0, 'product', '', 0),
