(32218, 1, '2026-01-17 11:41:03', '2026-01-17 11:41:03', '', 'purifying foaming cream – 150ml', '<strong>Skin concern:</strong> Suitable for combination to oily skins.\r\n<br>\r\nConcentrated in specific purifying and regulating actives, this cleansing cream creates a rich, unctuous, cleansing and repairing foam. Suitable for normal to oily skins and for problem skins, it gently eliminates dead cells, unclogs pores, normalizes and purifies the skin without harming or drying it. By fighting bacteria proliferation, responsible for skin problems, it guarantees a real hygiene of the skin.\r\n<br>\r\nSo gentle with its soap-free formula, a man can shave with this purifying foam, feeling refreshed and forgetting the pain of razor burns.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'purifying-foaming-cream-150ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 03:00:55', '2026-01-19 03:00:55', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32218', 0, 'product', '', 0),
