(32220, 1, '2026-01-17 11:46:14', '2026-01-17 11:46:14', '', 'mattifying active lotion', '<strong>Skin concerns:</strong> Suitable for oily skins\r\n\r\nThis lotion, concentrated in laminar algae and personalized with the mattifying active ingredient, balances the pH and prepares the skin for other treatments. The skin is luminous and the pores are reduced to a shine-free state.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'mattifying-active-lotion', '', '', '2026-01-19 04:03:45', '2026-01-19 04:03:45', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32220', 0, 'product', '', 0),
