(32223, 1, '2026-01-17 11:49:53', '2026-01-17 11:49:53', '', 'moisturizing active lotion', '<strong>Skin concerns:</strong> Suitable for dehydrated skins.\r\n\r\nA Gisèle Delorme exclusive, the active lotion is concentrated with laminaria seaweed and plant extracts.  A daily essential for a perfectly cleansed skin, it rebalances the pH level and prepares your skin for the next steps of your Gisèle Delorme skincare routine. With its moisturizing concentrate, your skin is impeccably hydrated and plumped, right from the cleansing process.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'moisturizing-active-lotion', '', '', '2026-01-19 04:11:01', '2026-01-19 04:11:01', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32223', 0, 'product', '', 0),
