(32226, 1, '2026-01-17 11:52:55', '2026-01-17 11:52:55', '', 'soothing active lotion', '<strong>Skin concerns:</strong> Suitable for sensitive and reactive skins.\r\n\r\nA Gisèle Delorme exclusive, the active lotion is concentrated with laminaria seaweed and plant extracts.  A daily essential for a perfectly cleansed skin, it rebalances the pH level and prepares your skin for the next steps of your Gisèle Delorme skincare routine. With its soothing concentrate, your skin is impeccably soothed and protected, right from the cleansing process.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'soothing-active-lotion', '', '', '2026-01-19 04:18:25', '2026-01-19 04:18:25', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32226', 0, 'product', '', 0),
