(32229, 1, '2026-01-17 11:55:14', '2026-01-17 11:55:14', '', 'seaweed mask – 50ml', '<strong>Skin concern:</strong> Suitable for every skin type except irritated/reactive skin.\r\n\r\nEssentially composed of 3 seaweeds (laminaria, ascophyllum and fucus), this facial mask provides an immediate and long-lasting effect. Highly concentrated in micronutrients, amino acids and minerals, it detoxifies, normalizes and revives dull, flattened and imbalanced skin. The grain of the skin is refined. The skin is clear and tonified.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'seaweed-mask-50ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 04:23:00', '2026-01-19 04:23:00', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32229', 0, 'product', '', 0),
