(32233, 1, '2026-01-17 11:58:58', '2026-01-17 11:58:58', '', 'purifying mask – 75ml', '<strong>Skin concern:</strong> Suitable for combination to oily skin.\r\n\r\nSuitable for problem and/or oily skin, it absorbs impurities and excess sebum, preventing redness and inflammation. Its formula, rich in specific purifying and soothing active ingredients (spirulina, burdock, green clay, essential oils of sage, tea tree and peppermint), contributes to the skin’s natural balance. It eliminates all traces of shine, leaving skin deeply purified and soothed.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'purifying-mask-75ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 04:35:20', '2026-01-19 04:35:20', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32233', 0, 'product', '', 0),
