(32235, 1, '2026-01-17 12:01:37', '2026-01-17 12:01:37', '', 'soothing mask – 50ml', '<strong>Skin concern:</strong> Suitable for the most sensitive, fragile, and reactive skins (redness, irritations, visible blood vessels, feeling of discomfort).\r\n\r\nThis mask, specially formulated for sensitive or dry skins, combines the protective properties of essential waxes from rose, acacia and narcissus flowers, with aloe vera and horse chestnut to relieve congestion, protect and moisturize the upper layers of the epidermis. It also helps to fight against redness.\r\n\r\nEnveloped with exquisite tenderness, the skin instantly regains softness and suppleness.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'soothing-mask-50ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 04:41:57', '2026-01-19 04:41:57', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32235', 0, 'product', '', 0),
