(32373, 1, '2026-01-19 04:55:34', '2026-01-19 04:55:34', '', 'energizing cream – 50ml', 'Anti-ageing care designed to seal in moisture and reveal skin’s radiance, while reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. Its hyaluronic acid-based formula contains powerful revitalizing active ingredients for bounced and radiant skin.\n\nIts gel texture contains fine light-reflecting particles for an instant healthy glow.\n', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '32243-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-01-19 04:55:34', '2026-01-19 04:55:34', '', 32243, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?p=32373', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
