(32247, 1, '2026-01-17 12:17:04', '2026-01-17 12:17:04', '', 'Firming essential serum', '<strong>The serum that defies gravity</strong>\r\n\r\n<strong>Skin Concern:</strong> Suitable for all skin types, including the eye area.\r\n\r\nA remarkable serum thanks to its exceptional formulation.\r\n\r\nIts high-performance formula is <b>the outcome of 36 months of R&amp;D</b> aimed at redefining the standards in anti-aging skincare. <b>Formulated to meet the needs of is sagging, thin and aging skin</b> this serum embodies perfection alliance between scientific innovation and cosmetic expertise.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'firming-essential-serum', '', '', '2026-01-19 05:06:41', '2026-01-19 05:06:41', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32247', 0, 'product', '', 0),
