(32253, 1, '2026-01-17 12:20:01', '2026-01-17 12:20:01', '', 'vitaminic complex – 30ml', '<strong>Skin concern:</strong> Suitable for every skin types, against premature skin aging.\r\n\r\nThe vitaminic complex serum is a potent antioxidant concentrated with 5% of vitamin E. This youth serum neutralizes free radicals responsible for the cells’ oxidation and loss of moisture level. Its unique solubilization process allows an unparalleled skin bioavailability of the vitamin.\r\n\r\nYour skin regains its elasticity and is instantly soothes and relaxed.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'vitaminic-complex-30ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 05:12:20', '2026-01-19 05:12:20', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32253', 0, 'product', '', 0),
