(32255, 1, '2026-01-17 12:22:02', '2026-01-17 12:22:02', '', 'purifying essential serum – 30ml', '<strong>Skin concerns:</strong> Suitable for combination to oily skins with imperfections.\r\n\r\nUltra-active purifying and regulating serum, it helps to correct visible imperfections of problem and/or oily skins (dilated pores, sebum excess, unpleasant redness). Its specific actives eliminate impurities, tighten pores, refine the grain of the skin and optimize complexion.\r\n\r\n\r\nRediscover a healthy, clear and glowing skin.\r\n', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'purifying-essential-serum-30ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 05:18:22', '2026-01-19 05:18:22', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32255', 0, 'product', '', 0),
