(32257, 1, '2026-01-17 12:26:20', '2026-01-17 12:26:20', '', 'nourishing essential serum – 30ml', '<strong>Skin concern:</strong> Mature skins, dry-prone, thin and wrinkled.\r\n\r\nOver time, the synthesis of essential components of the skin slows down. lt becomes thinner and more fragile.\r\nThe natural synthesis of lipids in the skin decreases. ln the epidermis, linoleic acid drops up to 40% (its nutritional role is essential). Thus the skin’s barrier function is weakened: less protected, the skin becomes dry, undernourished, prone to wrinkles and more fragile against external aggressions.\r\nThis is the reason why mature skin has very specific needs which require targeted treatments to restore comfort, density and vitality.\r\n\r\n<strong>THE SOLUTION:</strong>\r\n\r\nThis 100% active treatment-oil is the quintessence of natural anti-aging. Precious synergy of pure natural ingredients, it targets and repairs weakened areas, strengthens the natural defenses of the skin and smoothes out facial lines to restore absolute comfort and youthful appearance.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'nourishing-essential-serum-30ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 05:24:37', '2026-01-19 05:24:37', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32257', 0, 'product', '', 0),
