(32264, 1, '2026-01-17 12:34:01', '2026-01-17 12:34:01', '', 'moisturizing essential serum – 30ml', 'This powerful elixir of natural origin is THE Gisele Delorme solution for <strong>dehydrated skins, whatever the skin type is (dry, combination, normal).</strong>\r\n\r\nUltra-moisturizing synergy, this formula associate our famous laminaria seaweed concentrate to a subtle blend of essential oils and vegetable extracts.\r\nThis serum targets all signs related to skin dehydration and helps the epidermis to regenerate and recover comfort, elasticity and vitality.\r\n\r\nBeauty results:\r\n\r\n– Skin is instantly rehydrated,\r\n – Feelings of tightness disappear,\r\n – Skin is repulped, it recovers its elasticity,\r\n – Fine lines are smoothed out,\r\n – Skin becomes soft and comfortable,\r\n – Remineralized and revitalized, natural skin radiance is restored', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'moisturizing-essential-serum-30ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 05:42:29', '2026-01-19 05:42:29', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32264', 0, 'product', '', 0),
