(32266, 1, '2026-01-17 12:36:13', '2026-01-17 12:36:13', '', 'glow renovating essential serum – 30ml', '<strong>Skin concern:</strong> Suitable for all skin types, espacially dull and/or devitalized skins.\r\n\r\nThe glow renovating serum provides a targeted response to dull and/or mature skin. It helps improve the appearance of your skin by stimulating epidermal renewal, exfoliating dead cells and smoothing the skin texture to reveal a healthy and youthful glow.', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'glow-renovating-essential-serum-30ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 05:56:10', '2026-01-19 05:56:10', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32266', 0, 'product', '', 0),
