(32268, 1, '2026-01-17 12:39:25', '2026-01-17 12:39:25', '', 'detox arom’activ serum – 30ml', '<strong>Skin concerns:</strong> Suitable for combination to oily skins with imperfections, except raw or irritated skin.\r\n\r\nThis night arom’activ detox serum* contains a potent detoxifying complex, specially formulated for congested or imperfection-prone skin. It stimulates the elimination of toxins which helps rebalance your skin and stimulates cellular respiration. With its regulating properties, your skin is purified and decongested the next morning.\r\n\r\n<em>*Professional care formulation. Contains highly concentrated essential oils. Apply only at nighttime to avoid photosynthesis risks.</em>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'detox-aromactiv-serum-30ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 06:02:13', '2026-01-19 06:02:13', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32268', 0, 'product', '', 0),
