(32270, 1, '2026-01-17 12:41:34', '2026-01-17 12:41:34', '', 'repair arom’activ serum – 30ml', '<strong>Skin concerns:</strong> Suitable for sensitive, fragile and reactive skins except raw or irritated skins.\r\n\r\nThis nighttime serum* repairs, protects and regenerates sensitive, reactive and fragile skin thanks to its highly potent concentrated formula. This highly-concentrated formula favors the stimulation of cell respiration and renewal. It purifies and revitalizes your skin while protecting it from external aggressions.\r\n\r\n<em>*Professional care formulation. Contains highly concentrated essential oils. Apply only at nighttime to avoid photosynthesis risks.</em>', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'repair-aromactiv-serum-30ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 06:07:18', '2026-01-19 06:07:18', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32270', 0, 'product', '', 0),
