(32286, 1, '2026-01-17 12:56:32', '2026-01-17 12:56:32', '', 'enriched body lotion – 200ml', 'The body lotion is infused with fruit acids, vitamins and vegetable oils to repair and restore the skin’s radiance and comfort while smoothing the skin and promoting collagen synthesis.\r\n\r\n\r\nNaturally perfumed with sweet almond and coconut oils, it penetrates very easily and leaves the skin in perfect harmony.\r\n', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'enriched-body-lotion-200ml', '', '', '2026-01-19 06:34:09', '2026-01-19 06:34:09', '', 0, 'http://gisele.acutetest.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=32286', 0, 'product', '', 0),
